  <!-- ================================================================ Body -->
  <fo:page-sequence master-reference="book" initial-page-number="1">
    <fo:static-content flow-name="foot-odd"><fo:block text-align="end" end-indent="7mm" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7pt" color="#6b7275"><fo:retrieve-marker retrieve-class-name="chapter" retrieve-position="first-including-carryover"/> | <fo:page-number/></fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:static-content flow-name="foot-even"><fo:block text-align="start" start-indent="7mm" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7pt" color="#6b7275"><fo:page-number/> | Kumiori Conformance Guide — XSL-FO 1.1</fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:static-content flow-name="tab-odd"><fo:block><fo:retrieve-marker retrieve-class-name="tab-odd" retrieve-position="first-including-carryover"/></fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:static-content flow-name="tab-even"><fo:block><fo:retrieve-marker retrieve-class-name="tab-even" retrieve-position="first-including-carryover"/></fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:static-content flow-name="xsl-footnote-separator"><fo:block line-height="1" padding-after="2pt"><fo:leader leader-pattern="rule" leader-length="30mm" rule-thickness="0.5pt" color="#6b7275"/></fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body" text-align="justify">

      <!-- ──────────────── 1 Introduction -->
      <fo:block id="ch-intro" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">Introduction</fo:marker><!--tab:1--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="0.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">1</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="0.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">1</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">1</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">Introduction</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Kumiori (組み織り) is a typesetting engine that produces PDF from XSL-FO and from HTML and CSS. This document takes up those elements and properties of XSL-FO 1.1 that are commonly used when typesetting documents, and shows how Kumiori handles each of them with examples that were actually typeset. For each item, the following are placed side by side.</fo:block>
      <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="5mm" provisional-label-separation="2mm" space-before="2mm" space-after="2mm">
        <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block color="#b5562b">●</fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>The property definition (the small line under the section heading). The "Value", "Initial" and "Inherited" entries from the tables in XSL 1.1 §7 are reproduced verbatim, together with a quotation from the specification text (in English) with its section number.</fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
        <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block color="#b5562b">●</fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>How Kumiori handles it (support status and description)</fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
        <fo:list-item><fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()"><fo:block color="#b5562b">●</fo:block></fo:list-item-label><fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()"><fo:block>An example typeset by Kumiori (inside the thin frame) and its sample code (on the grey background below; the bold text on a yellow background is the setting the section is about)</fo:block></fo:list-item-body></fo:list-item>
      </fo:list-block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">The typeset example and the sample code are produced from the same source. Each sample is written once in the manuscript (docs/conformance/fo/kumiori-xsl-fo.fo), typeset as the example, and a display of its code is inserted after it. The same samples are also typeset one by one and checked in Kumiori's tests (test/conformance.test.ts).</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">"Supported", "Partial" and "Unsupported" were determined as follows. A document that specifies the element or property and one that does not are both loaded by Kumiori, and the content handed to the typesetter (the logical tree) is compared. Where the content does not change and the loader does not interpret the name, the item is marked Unsupported (Chapter 13). Where the content does change, the typeset example has been checked by eye to confirm that it is laid out as the specification says.</fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-1-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">1.1 </fo:inline>Support status</fo:block>
      <fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="8.5pt">
        <fo:table-column column-width="22mm"/>
        <fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
        <fo:table-body>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block><fo:inline background-color="#2e7d4f" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.5pt" padding="0.5pt 3pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Typeset as specified.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block><fo:inline background-color="#b7791f" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.5pt" padding="0.5pt 3pt">Partial</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>The main uses are supported, but some values or combinations are not handled (noted in the description).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block><fo:inline background-color="#8a8a8a" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.5pt" padding="0.5pt 3pt">Unsupported</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Ignored (the text inside the element is typeset as far as possible).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
        </fo:table-body>
      </fo:table>

      <fo:block id="s-1-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">1.2 </fo:inline>Typesetting environment</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">This document is typeset with the default of the Kumiori command (<fo:inline font-family="monospace" keep-together.within-line="always">--compat spec</fo:inline>, the setting that typesets with the XSL-FO 1.1 initial values; Appendix B). The fonts are Kumiori's defaults (Noto Serif JP and Noto Sans JP for Japanese, Tinos and Arimo for Latin text, Cousine for monospace). The specification text is quoted from the W3C Recommendations and Candidate Recommendation (MathML Core) retrieved on 2026-11-06 (Appendix C).</fo:block>

      <!-- ──────────────── 2 Page construction -->
      <fo:block id="ch-pages" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">Page construction</fo:marker><!--tab:2--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="15.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">2</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="15.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">2</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">2</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">Page construction</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">The page size and the placement of the regions are decided inside fo:layout-master-set. The items in this chapter cannot be written inside the flowed content (fo:flow), so instead of samples this chapter shows how this document itself is put together.</fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-2-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">2.1 </fo:inline>fo:simple-page-master, fo:region-body and others<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:simple-page-master is used in the generation of pages and specifies the geometry of the page. The page is subdivided into regions: one or more region-body, and up to four other regions: region-before, region-after, region-start, and region-end.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.4.13</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">The body of this document is typeset with two page masters (odd and even) that swap the positions of the gutter and the fore edge between left and right. Both have a region-after (the page number and the name of the chapter or of the document), and a <fo:inline keep-together.within-line="always">region-end</fo:inline> (odd pages) or <fo:inline keep-together.within-line="always">region-start</fo:inline> (even pages) is placed on the fore-edge side to show the chapter tab. The margin on the fore-edge side is 0, and the body margin is taken with the margin of region-body. The page masters of Chapter 12 set column-count="2" on region-body to give two columns.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">The shorthand size on fo:simple-page-master (XSL 1.1 §7.31.21) is mapped to page-width and page-height. One length sets both the width and the height; two lengths are the width and the height, in that order. auto and portrait give the sheet size (A4 portrait), and landscape gives that size with the longer sides horizontal. When page-width or page-height is also written, that property is used.</fo:block>

      <!--gen:vals-s-2-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">page-width</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.15)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The page width is determined from the size of the medium (paper). If no media information is available, the formatter decides.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">indefinite</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The page width is determined from the size of the typeset content.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The page width is set to the given length.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">page-height</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.13)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The page height is determined from the size of the medium (paper). If no media information is available, the formatter decides.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">indefinite</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The page height is determined from the size of the typeset content.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The page height is set to the given length.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">precedence</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.16)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">false</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>This region is shortened by the extent of the adjacent regions and does not reach the page corners.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">true</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>This region extends from edge to edge of the content area, and the four corners are included in it.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: interpreted only on region-before and region-after</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-2-1-->
<fo:block id="s-2-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">2.2 </fo:inline>fo:page-sequence-master<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:page-sequence-master is used to specify the constraints on and the order in which a given set of page-masters will be used in generating a sequence of pages.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.4.8</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">fo:repeatable-page-master-alternatives and the odd-or-even of fo:conditional-page-master-reference assign different masters to odd and even pages. page-position (first, last, only, rest), blank-or-not-blank, maximum-repeats, fo:single-page-master-reference and fo:repeatable-page-master-reference are supported as well.</fo:block>

      <!--gen:vals-s-2-2--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">page-position</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.14)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">only</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>This page master may be chosen when the page sequence has only one page (the first and last page).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">first</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>This page master may be chosen for the first page of the page sequence.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">last</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>This page master may be chosen for the last page of the page sequence.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">rest</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>This page master may be chosen for a page that is neither the first nor the last.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">any</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>This page master may be chosen regardless of the page position.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">odd-or-even</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.12)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">odd</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>This page master may be chosen when the page number (folio) is odd.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">even</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>This page master may be chosen when the page number is even.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">any</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>This page master may be chosen whether the page number is odd or even.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">blank-or-not-blank</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.1)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">blank</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>This page master may be chosen for a page that carries no content from the body flow (fo:flow), such as one generated to make the page count even or odd.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">not-blank</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>This page master may be chosen for a page that carries content from the body flow.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">any</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>This page master may be chosen at any time.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">maximum-repeats</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.10)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">no-limit</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>No limit is placed on the number of pages generated by this part.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;number&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The maximum number of pages generated by this part. If it is 0, this reference is not used.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-2-2-->
      <fo:wrapper index-key="doc:page-number"/>
<fo:block id="s-2-3" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">2.3 </fo:inline>fo:static-content, fo:marker, fo:retrieve-marker<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:marker is used in conjunction with fo:retrieve-marker or fo:retrieve-table-marker to produce running headers or footers and dynamic table headers or footers.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.13.5</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">At the bottom right of odd pages, the fo:marker placed in the chapter heading is retrieved with fo:retrieve-marker to show the chapter name and the page number (fo:page-number) (retrieve-position="first-including-carryover"). The bottom left of even pages shows the page number and the document name. The chapter tabs, too, are the chapter heading's fo:marker retrieved in the fo:static-content on the fore-edge side (<fo:inline keep-together.within-line="always">region-end</fo:inline> and <fo:inline keep-together.within-line="always">region-start</fo:inline>). The content of the fo:marker is a block whose top padding varies with the chapter number. The table of contents uses format="i" for Roman-numeral page numbers.</fo:block>

      <!--gen:vals-s-2-3--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">retrieve-position</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.25.4)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">first-starting-within-page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Retrieves the first of the markers attached to areas that start on the page.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">first-including-carryover</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Retrieves the first of the markers attached to areas on the page, including areas carried over from the previous page.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">last-starting-within-page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Retrieves the last of the markers attached to areas that start on the page.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">last-ending-within-page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Retrieves the last of the markers attached to areas that end on the page.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">retrieve-boundary</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.25.5)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Only markers on the page itself can be retrieved.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">page-sequence</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Only markers within the same fo:page-sequence can be retrieved (they can be carried over from previous pages).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">document</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Any marker in the document can be retrieved (they can also be carried over from a previous fo:page-sequence).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-2-3-->
<fo:block id="s-2-4" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">2.4 </fo:inline>fo:bookmark-tree<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:bookmark-tree formatting object is used to hold a list of access points within the document such as a table of contents, a list of figures or tables, etc. Each access point is called a bookmark.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.11.1</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">The PDF of this document has bookmarks for each chapter and section. The entries of the table of contents jump to each chapter through fo:basic-link, and the page numbers are drawn with fo:page-number-citation.</fo:block>

      <!--gen:vals-s-2-4--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">starting-state</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.23.10)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">show</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The content is shown from the start (for bookmarks, the child bookmarks start out expanded).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">hide</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The content is hidden at first (for bookmarks, the child bookmarks start out collapsed).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">internal-destination</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.23.8)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">empty string</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>No link target inside the document.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;idref&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The element with that id inside the document is the link target.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">external-destination</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.23.6)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">empty string</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>No link target outside the document.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;uri-specification&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A resource outside the document (URI) is the link target.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported (not interpreted on fo:bookmark; supported on fo:basic-link, §4.3)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-2-4-->
<!-- ──────────────── 3 Blocks -->
      <fo:block id="ch-block" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">Blocks</fo:marker><!--tab:3--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="30.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">3</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="30.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">3</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">3</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">Blocks</fo:block></fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-3-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">3.1 </fo:inline>fo:block<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:block formatting object is commonly used for formatting paragraphs, titles, headlines, figure and table captions, etc.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.5.2</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Margins (margin, space-before, space-after, start-indent, end-indent), borders (border: solid, dashed, dotted, double, groove, ridge, inset, outset), padding, background colors and images, and first-line indentation (text-indent) are supported. Adjacent space-before and space-after values are merged by the rules of the specification (§4.3).</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Change bars (fo:change-bar-begin and fo:change-bar-end; XSL 1.1 §6.13.2, §6.13.3) are supported. A bar is drawn beside the lines in the document-order range from a begin to the end that has the same change-bar-class at the matching nesting level (the begin and end may sit in different blocks or between table rows; nested and overlapping ranges each get their own bar). The bar is centered at change-bar-offset (initially 6pt) outward from the edge of the column, and its color, thickness and line style come from change-bar-color, change-bar-width and change-bar-style (the initial value is none, so no bar is drawn unless a style is given). change-bar-placement supports start, end, left, right, inside, outside and alternate (for inside and outside, the binding edge is taken to be the start edge on odd pages and the end edge on even pages; in vertical writing, left and right are treated as start and end). Bars are drawn for lines in the body (region-body), not in footnote bodies, fo:static-content or before-floats. No bar is drawn for areas without lines (an empty block, or a box that is only spacing), and z-index on fo:change-bar-begin is not read.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">fo:initial-property-set (XSL 1.1 §6.6.4) applies formatting to the first line of an fo:block only. The characters that fall on the first line get the font properties (font-family, font-size, font-weight, font-style, font-stretch), color, letter-spacing, word-spacing, text-decoration and background-color (for an fo:inline that spans lines, only the part on the first line). The first line is broken using that formatting. text-transform, font-variant, line-height, borders, padding, relative positioning (relative-position), text-shadow and score-spaces cannot be applied to the first line only, so they are not read and are reported in the import warnings.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">An fo:block with relative-position="relative" (XSL 1.1 §7.13.5; also the shorthand position="relative") is drawn with its laid-out box shifted by left and top (or, when those are absent, by the opposite of right and bottom). The positions of the surrounding boxes do not change. relative on elements other than fo:block, and on blocks in vertical writing, is not supported. hidden and collapse of visibility (§7.30.17) keep the space but do not draw the text, images, background or borders (the property is inherited and can be turned back with visible). The collapse behavior that removes table rows and columns is not supported and is treated like hidden. For z-index (§7.30.18), an absolutely positioned fo:block-container is drawn behind the body text when the value added to the parent values (§5.4.5) is negative. Boxes with values of 0 or more keep the document order. The combinations that are not supported are reported in a warning at load time.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">The shorthand background (XSL 1.1 §7.31.1) is split into background-color, background-image, background-repeat and background-position (the background-attachment keyword is discarded). When an individual property is also written, the individual property is used (§5.2).</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-3-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">space-before</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.11.5)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;space&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the minimum, optimum and maximum values of the space before the block, whether it is discarded at a page break (conditionality), and its precedence when merged with adjacent spaces.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: .minimum and .maximum are not used</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">text-indent</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.16.11)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Indents the first line by the given length. A negative value makes the first line protrude (a hanging indent).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the first-line indentation as a percentage of the width of the containing block.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">border-before-style</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.8.8 (values: §7.8.20))</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>No border is drawn (the border width becomes 0).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">hidden</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Same as none, but in table border resolution it suppresses the other borders.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">dotted</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A border made of a series of dots.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">dashed</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A border made of a series of short dashes.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">solid</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A single solid line.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">double</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Two solid lines. The two lines and the gap between them add up to the border width.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">groove</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A border that looks as if carved into the surface.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ridge</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The opposite of groove: a border that looks as if raised from the surface.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">inset</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A border that makes the whole box look embedded in the surface.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">outset</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The opposite of inset: a border that makes the whole box look raised from the surface.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">background-color</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.8.2)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">transparent</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The background is not painted; whatever lies underneath shows through.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;color&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Paints the background with that color. In XSL the rgb-icc() function may also be used.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-3-1-->
<?kumiori-sample id="block-box" mark="border=&quot;1.5pt double #1f3a5f&quot;|padding=&quot;6pt&quot;|text-indent=&quot;1em&quot;|margin-left=&quot;12mm&quot;|border-start-style=&quot;solid&quot;|padding-start=&quot;6pt&quot;"?>
<fo:block space-before="4pt" padding="6pt" border="1.5pt double #1f3a5f"
    background-color="#eef2f8" text-indent="1em">
  二重の罫線と内側の余白を持つ段落です。字下げは 1em です。
</fo:block>
<fo:block space-before="8pt" margin-left="12mm" border-start-style="solid"
    border-start-width="3pt" border-start-color="#b5562b" padding-start="6pt">
  左に 12mm 下げ、左側だけに罫線を引いた段落です。
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-3-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">3.2 </fo:inline>fo:block-container (vertical writing)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:block-container flow object is used to generate a block-level reference-area, typically containing text blocks with a different writing-mode. In addition, it can also be used with a different reference-orientation to rotate its content.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.5.3</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“tb-rl: Inline components and text within a line are written top-to-bottom. Lines and blocks are placed right-to-left.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.29.7 "writing-mode"</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">In vertical writing with writing-mode="tb-rl", Japanese characters are set upright and Latin characters are rotated sideways. Vertical glyph forms (OpenType vert) are used, so punctuation and brackets take their vertical shapes. The size limits (min-height, max-height, min-width, max-width; XSL 1.1 §7.15.8–§7.15.11) are mapped to the .minimum and .maximum components of block-progression-dimension or inline-progression-dimension according to the writing mode (§5.3.3). On a box in horizontal writing, min-height becomes the lower bound of the height, and max-width and min-width become the upper and lower bounds of the width (when no width is given, the box takes the upper bound if the available width is wider than it, and the lower bound if the available width is narrower than it). On fo:table-row, the limits in the block-progression direction (min-height and max-height in horizontal writing, min-width and max-width in vertical writing) become the lower and upper bounds of the row height. max-height on a box in horizontal writing, and all four limits on a box in vertical writing, are not supported (a warning at load time reports them; only max-width on a vertical fo:block-container caps the content width when no width is given).</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">glyph-orientation-vertical (XSL 1.1 §7.29.3) decides the orientation of glyphs in vertical writing. auto (the initial value) sets Japanese characters upright and rotates Latin characters as described above, 0deg sets all glyphs upright, and 90deg rotates all glyphs 90 degrees clockwise. The angle is written with the unit deg, grad or rad and is rounded to the closest of 0, 90, 180 and 270 degrees. 180 and 270 degrees, and values other than 0 degrees for the orientation of glyphs in horizontal writing (glyph-orientation-horizontal), are not supported (a warning at load time reports them).</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">writing-mode="rl-tb" (right-to-left horizontal writing) supports languages written from right to left, such as Arabic and Hebrew. Lines of Hebrew and Arabic text are reordered by the rules of the Unicode Bidirectional Algorithm (UAX #9), including mixing with digits and Latin text, mirrored brackets, and embedding and overriding with fo:bidi-override. Arabic letters take the forms that join to their neighbours (initial, medial, final and isolated forms, plus the mandatory ligatures). A font with Arabic glyphs is required (Kumiori's default fonts have none, so pass one with the --font option of the CLI or the fonts option of the library). Arabic can be mixed into part of a paragraph, and digits or Latin text can be mixed into an Arabic paragraph.</fo:block>
      <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:external-graphic src="images/arabic-sample.png" content-width="100mm" border="0.3pt solid #cfd4d2"/></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.5" color="#3b4245" space-after="3mm">Typeset example of Arabic (set with Noto Naskh Arabic passed via --font). The first paragraph is an Arabic paragraph with writing-mode="rl-tb" (containing digits, Latin text and brackets), the second is Arabic inside Latin text, and the third is Arabic inside Japanese text</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-3-2--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">writing-mode</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.29.7)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">lr-tb</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Text within a line runs left to right; lines and blocks stack top to bottom (ordinary horizontal writing for Latin scripts).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">rl-tb</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Text within a line runs right to left; lines and blocks stack top to bottom (horizontal writing for Arabic and Hebrew).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">tb-rl</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Text within a line runs top to bottom; lines and blocks stack right to left (vertical writing for Japanese and Chinese).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">tb-lr</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Text within a line runs top to bottom; lines and blocks stack left to right.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">bt-lr</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Text within a line runs bottom to top; lines and blocks stack left to right.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: sideways Latin glyphs keep their top-to-bottom orientation</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">bt-rl</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Text within a line runs bottom to top; lines and blocks stack right to left.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: sideways Latin glyphs keep their top-to-bottom orientation</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">lr-bt</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Text within a line runs left to right; lines and blocks stack bottom to top.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">rl-bt</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Text within a line runs right to left; lines and blocks stack bottom to top.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">lr-alternating-rl-bt</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Odd lines run left to right and even lines right to left, alternating; lines and blocks stack bottom to top.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">lr-alternating-rl-tb</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Odd lines run left to right and even lines right to left, alternating; lines and blocks stack top to bottom.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">lr-inverting-rl-bt</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Odd lines run left to right and even lines run right to left with inverted glyphs; lines and blocks stack bottom to top.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">lr-inverting-rl-tb</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Odd lines run left to right and even lines run right to left with inverted glyphs; lines and blocks stack top to bottom.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">tb-lr-in-lr-pairs</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Pairs of two characters set left to right are stacked top to bottom to form a line; lines and blocks stack left to right.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: each pair is set as tate-chu-yoko fitted to 1 em (two full-width characters are compressed)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">lr</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Shorthand for lr-tb.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">rl</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Shorthand for rl-tb.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">tb</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Shorthand for tb-rl.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">display-align</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.14.4)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Follows relative-align on elements where it applies; otherwise the same as before.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">before</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Aligns the content to the before edge of the reference area (the top in horizontal writing, the right in vertical writing).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">center</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Centers the content in the block-progression direction of the reference area.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">after</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Aligns the content to the after edge of the reference area (the bottom in horizontal writing, the left in vertical writing).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-3-2-->
<?kumiori-sample id="vertical" mark="writing-mode=&quot;tb-rl&quot;"?>
<fo:block-container writing-mode="tb-rl" height="36mm" width="100%"
    border="0.6pt solid #9fb0cc" padding="4pt">
  <fo:block>縦書きの段落です。「かぎ括弧」や、句読点の形が縦書き用に変わります。</fo:block>
  <fo:block>欧字の Kumiori や 2026 は横に倒し、漢数字の二〇二六は縦に並びます。</fo:block>
</fo:block-container>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-3-3" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">3.3 </fo:inline>reference-orientation (rotation)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Values</fo:inline> : 0 | 90 | 180 | 270 | -90 | -180 | -270 | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : 0　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : no　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(reference-orientation — XSL 1.1 §7.21.3)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“90: The reference-orientation of this reference-area is rotated 90 degrees counter-clockwise from the reference-orientation of the containing reference-area.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.21.3</fo:block></fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-3-3--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">reference-orientation</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.21.3)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">0</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The same orientation as the containing reference area.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">90</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Rotated 90 degrees counter-clockwise from the containing reference area.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">180</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Rotated 180 degrees counter-clockwise from the containing reference area.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">270</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Rotated 270 degrees counter-clockwise from the containing reference area.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">-90</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Rotated 270 degrees counter-clockwise (the same as 270).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">-180</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Rotated 180 degrees counter-clockwise (the same as 180).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">-270</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Rotated 90 degrees counter-clockwise (the same as 90).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-3-3-->
<?kumiori-sample id="rotate" mark="reference-orientation=&quot;90&quot;"?>
<fo:block-container reference-orientation="90" width="20mm" height="34mm"
    background-color="#fdf3e2" border="0.6pt solid #b5562b" padding="3pt">
  <fo:block font-family="sans-serif">90 度回した箱の中身です。</fo:block>
</fo:block-container>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <!-- ──────────────── 4 Inline elements -->
      <fo:block id="ch-inline" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">Inline elements</fo:marker><!--tab:4--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="45.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">4</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="45.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">4</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">4</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">Inline elements</fo:block></fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-4-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">4.1 </fo:inline>fo:inline and baseline-shift<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Values</fo:inline> : baseline | sub | super | &lt;percentage&gt; | &lt;length&gt; | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : baseline　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : no　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(baseline-shift — XSL 1.1 §7.14.3)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:inline formatting object is commonly used for formatting a portion of text with a background or enclosing it in a border.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.6.7</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The "baseline-shift" property allows repositioning of the dominant-baseline relative to the dominant-baseline of the parent area. The shifted object might be a subscript or superscript.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.14.3</fo:block></fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-4-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">baseline-shift</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.14.3)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">baseline</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The baseline is not shifted.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">sub</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Lowers the baseline to the subscript position determined from the font metrics.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: the font metrics are not used; the baseline is lowered by 0.2 times the font size</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">super</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Raises the baseline to the superscript position determined from the font metrics.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: the font metrics are not used; the baseline is raised by 0.35 times the font size</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Shifts the baseline by a percentage of the line-height of the parent area (positive values shift upward).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Shifts the baseline by the given length (positive values shift upward).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-4-1-->
<?kumiori-sample id="inline" mark="&lt;fo:inline|baseline-shift=&quot;super&quot;|baseline-shift=&quot;sub&quot;"?>
<fo:block>文の中の<fo:inline background-color="#fff1b8">背景</fo:inline>、<fo:inline
    border="0.8pt solid #1f3a5f" padding="0 2pt">囲み</fo:inline>、<fo:inline
    font-weight="bold" color="#b5562b">太字と色</fo:inline>、<fo:inline
    text-decoration="underline">下線</fo:inline>。上付きの E = mc<fo:inline
    baseline-shift="super" font-size="70%">2</fo:inline>、下付きの H<fo:inline
    baseline-shift="sub" font-size="70%">2</fo:inline>O。</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:wrapper index-key="doc:leader"/>
      <fo:block id="s-4-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">4.2 </fo:inline>fo:leader<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:leader formatting object is often used: in table-of-contents to generate sequences of "." glyphs that separate titles from page numbers”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.6.9</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">The leader-pattern values space, dots, rule and use-content are supported. dots and use-content are laid out aligned at intervals of leader-pattern-width.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">leader-alignment (XSL 1.1 §7.22.1) aligns the start of each cycle of a dots or use-content leader to a grid. reference-area uses a grid of leader-pattern-width steps from the content start edge of the reference area (the body region, a column, or a table cell); page uses a grid from the start edge of the page. The dots then line up vertically even across lines with different indents. none (the initial value) places the cycles on a grid from the start of the line. In right-to-left lines, inside a rotated fo:block-container and inside fo:static-content it is treated as none (an fo:block-container is not counted as a reference area; the enclosing reference area is used). The table-of-contents pattern in which wrapped lines stop short of end-indent and only the last line, with the page number, runs to the edge (text-align-last="justify" with end-indent and a negative last-line-end-indent) is supported through last-line-end-indent, described in section 5.2.</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-4-2--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">leader-pattern</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.22.2)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">space</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Fills the leader with blank space.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">rule</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Fills the leader with a rule. The appearance of the rule is set by rule-thickness and rule-style.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">dots</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Fills the leader with repeated dots.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">use-content</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Fills the leader by repeating the content of the fo:leader.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: only the characters of the content are repeated</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">leader-length</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.22.4)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length-range&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the minimum, optimum and maximum length of the leader. The leader length is kept within this range.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the leader length as a percentage of the content width of the parent area.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">rule-style</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.22.5)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>No rule is drawn (rule-thickness becomes 0).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">dotted</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A border made of a series of dots.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">dashed</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A border made of a series of short dashes.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">solid</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A single line segment.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">double</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Two solid lines. The two lines and the gap between them add up to rule-thickness.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">groove</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A border that looks as if carved into the surface.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ridge</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The opposite of groove: a border that looks as if raised from the surface.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">leader-alignment</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.22.1)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The leader pattern is not specially aligned.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">reference-area</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Aligns the leader pattern as if it started at the start edge of the content of the reference area.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Aligns the leader pattern as if it started at the start edge of the page.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-4-2-->
<?kumiori-sample id="leader" mark="leader-pattern=&quot;dots&quot;|leader-pattern=&quot;rule&quot;|leader-pattern=&quot;use-content&quot;"?>
<fo:block text-align-last="justify">第 1 章 はじめに
  <fo:leader leader-pattern="dots"/> 1</fo:block>
<fo:block text-align-last="justify">第 2 章 ページの組み立て
  <fo:leader leader-pattern="rule" rule-thickness="0.5pt"
      rule-style="dashed"/> 2</fo:block>
<fo:block text-align-last="justify">第 3 章 ブロック
  <fo:leader leader-pattern="use-content">・</fo:leader> 3</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:wrapper index-key="doc:page-number"/>
      <fo:block id="s-4-3" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">4.3 </fo:inline>fo:page-number, fo:page-number-citation and fo:basic-link<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:page-number-citation is used to reference the page-number for the page containing the first normal area returned by the cited formatting object.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.6.11</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">fo:page-number-citation-last (the last page of the cited element) is also supported. fo:basic-link turns both destinations inside the document (internal-destination) and external URIs (external-destination) into PDF links. For external links (including external-destination of fo:bookmark), by default only URLs whose scheme is http, https, mailto or tel, and relative references to a PDF, become links. Other schemes (javascript:, file: and so on) and actions that open a file (relative non-PDF files, absolute paths) do not become links: the text is typeset as is and a warning is reported (this can be chosen with links in the API, and --link-schemes and --link-launch on the command line). The sample below contains a reference to its own paragraph and a link to the W3C specification.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Digit grouping of page numbers is supported. When both grouping-separator (a single separator character) and grouping-size (the number of digits) are given on fo:page-sequence, numbers in a decimal format (format of 1, 01, １ and so on) are grouped from the right every grouping-size digits (XSL 1.1 §7.26.2, §7.26.3; XSLT 1.0 §7.7.1; for example 1,234). If only one of them is given, it is ignored. letter-value (§7.26.4) chooses between two letter-based numbering sequences in languages that have both, but none of the format tokens Kumiori supports (a, A, i, I, 一 and so on) can be read in two ways, so the result is the same for every value.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">The contents (text and inline-level elements) of fo:folio-prefix and fo:folio-suffix (XSL 1.1 §6.6.13, §6.6.14), children of fo:page-sequence, are placed before and after page numbers (per-chapter folios such as “A-12”). fo:page-number takes those of the fo:page-sequence that contains it (§6.6.10). fo:page-number-citation and fo:page-number-citation-last take those of the fo:page-sequence that generated the cited page (the fo:page-sequence containing the element with the ref-id; §6.6.11, §6.6.12). The contents are typeset with the formatting in effect at the page number. fo:page-number, fo:page-number-citation and block-level elements, which are not allowed inside, are not read and are reported in a warning at load time.</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-4-3--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ref-id</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.30.13)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;idref&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Refers to the element with that id in the formatting object tree (fo:page-number-citation cites the page number of that element).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">internal-destination</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.23.8)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">empty string</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>No destination inside the document.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;idref&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The element with that id in the document is the destination.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">external-destination</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.23.6)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">empty string</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>No destination outside the document.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;uri-specification&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A resource outside the document (a URI) is the destination.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">show-destination</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.23.9)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">replace</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Replaces the current document view with the destination.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">new</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Opens the destination in a new window.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-4-3-->
<?kumiori-sample id="citation" mark="&lt;fo:page-number/&gt;|&lt;fo:page-number-citation ref-id=&quot;here&quot;/&gt;|internal-destination=&quot;here&quot;|external-destination"?>
<fo:block id="here">この段落は <fo:page-number/> ページにあります。<fo:basic-link
    internal-destination="here" color="#1f3a5f"
    text-decoration="underline">この段落</fo:basic-link>への参照:
  <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="here"/> ページ。外へのリンク: <fo:basic-link
    external-destination="url('https://www.w3.org/TR/xsl11/')" color="#1f3a5f"
    text-decoration="underline">XSL 1.1</fo:basic-link>。</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-4-4" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">4.4 </fo:inline>fo:character and fo:bidi-override<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:bidi-override formatting object is used when the Unicode BIDI algorithm fails. It forces a string of text to be written in a specific direction.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.6.2</fo:block></fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-4-4--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">character</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.17.1)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;character&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the Unicode character to display.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">unicode-bidi</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.29.6)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Does not open a new embedding level in the bidirectional algorithm.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">embed</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Opens one embedding level (its direction is set by direction). Inside it, implicit reordering applies.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">bidi-override</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Lays out the characters inside strictly in the direction given by direction, without implicit reordering.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">direction</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.29.1)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ltr</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Left-to-right direction.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">rtl</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Right-to-left direction.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-4-4-->
<?kumiori-sample id="character" mark="character=&quot;★&quot;|character=&quot;§&quot;|direction=&quot;rtl&quot;|unicode-bidi=&quot;bidi-override&quot;"?>
<fo:block>fo:character で置いた字: <fo:character character="★" color="#b5562b"/><fo:character
    character="§"/>。向きを逆にした字の並び: <fo:bidi-override direction="rtl"
    unicode-bidi="bidi-override">ABC 123</fo:bidi-override>。</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-4-5" index-key="doc:index" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">4.5 </fo:inline>Indexes (fo:index-page-citation-list and related)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The formatting objects and properties for indexing enable the generation of lists of page numbers associated with specific items in the formatting object tree, such as for use in back-of-the-book indexes.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.10.1</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Put an index-key on elements in the text, and an fo:index-page-citation-list in the back-of-the-book index is typeset as the list of page numbers on which the places with that key appear. A key can be put on any element that takes an id (fo:block, fo:inline, fo:wrapper, tables, table rows and cells, list items, fo:block-container, images, fo:page-sequence and so on). An empty fo:wrapper is a point anchor. Everything from an fo:index-range-begin to the fo:index-range-end whose ref-id equals its id is a “range”, and all the pages in between are cited. When a block or an inline element with a key spans pages, every page that holds one of its areas is cited (§6.10.6). An anchor that generates no area (an empty fo:wrapper or an fo:index-range-begin) placed between blocks cites the page of the content that follows it.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">The list of page numbers is built as the specification describes (Steps A to C of §6.10.7). Within one fo:index-key-reference, items that cite the same page are reduced to one. When several fo:index-key-reference elements cite the same page, only the first in document order is kept if merge-pages-across-index-key-references is merge (the initial value), and all are kept if it is leave-separate. Three or more consecutive pages are merged into a range if merge-sequential-page-numbers is merge (the initial value). Pages with different index-class values, and pages from different fo:index-key-reference elements when merge-ranges-across-index-key-references is leave-separate, are never merged into one range even when consecutive. The range separator is U+2013 (EN DASH) and the list separator is a comma followed by a space; both can be replaced with the content of fo:index-page-citation-range-separator and fo:index-page-citation-list-separator.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">A page number is formatted with the format of the fo:page-sequence that generated the cited page, with its fo:folio-prefix and fo:folio-suffix around it (§6.6.10, as for fo:page-number-citation). The character formatting (bold, colour and so on) is that of the citing fo:index-key-reference. The content of fo:index-page-number-prefix and fo:index-page-number-suffix is placed before and after the number, on the same line as the number. With page-number-treatment="link", the number becomes a link to the cited place (or to the page itself, when the place is not on that page).</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">The length of an index list is not known until the pages are known. As with fo:page-number-citation, the lists are built from the typeset result and the document is typeset again until the lists stay the same (the first run plus at most four more). When the index comes after the text, one run is enough. If the index keeps growing, adding pages and changing the cited pages again, typesetting stops at the limit and a warning is issued. An fo:index-key-reference whose key does not exist is ignored (§6.10.6) with a warning. A range with no matching fo:index-range-end extends to the end of the document (§6.10.4). An fo:index-range-end with no matching fo:index-range-begin is ignored (§6.10.5). An index-key on an element whose id is not passed to layout (fo:leader, fo:page-number-citation, fo:footnote and so on) is not read and is reported in the import warnings. Collecting and sorting the entries and typesetting the entry terms is the job of the stylesheet, as the specification says (note in §6.10.1).</fo:block>
<fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"><fo:table-column column-width="46mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Element / property</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Handling in Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">index-key, index-class</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.24.2, §7.24.1</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The key and the class. index-class on an element without index-key is ignored.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:index-range-begin, fo:index-range-end</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.10.4, §6.10.5</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The start of a range (needs id and index-key) and its end (ref-id). They generate no area.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:index-page-citation-list</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.10.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The inline element that is typeset as the list of page numbers. Reads merge-sequential-page-numbers, merge-ranges-across-index-key-references and merge-pages-across-index-key-references (each merge | leave-separate, inherited).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:index-key-reference</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.10.6</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Cites the key given by ref-index-key. Carries page-number-treatment (link | no-link, inherited) and the character formatting of the numbers.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:index-page-number-prefix, -suffix</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.10.2, §6.10.3</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Text placed before and after a number (text and inline-level elements). In a range, it is attached to both the first and the last number.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:index-page-citation-list-separator, -range-separator</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.10.8, §6.10.9</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The list separator and the range separator (text and inline-level elements).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>
      <fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">An index built from keys placed in this manual (excerpt). The numbers are links. The table of contents (roman page numbers) and the main text use different index-class values.</fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="8pt" start-indent="4mm" end-indent="40mm" text-align-last="justify" keep-with-previous.within-page="always">Footnotes and floats (chapter 8) <fo:leader leader-pattern="dots" leader-pattern-width="3pt" color="#6b7275"/> <fo:index-page-citation-list><fo:index-key-reference ref-index-key="doc:out" page-number-treatment="link" color="#1f3a5f"/></fo:index-page-citation-list></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="8pt" start-indent="4mm" end-indent="40mm" text-align-last="justify" keep-with-previous.within-page="always">Images (chapter 9) <fo:leader leader-pattern="dots" leader-pattern-width="3pt" color="#6b7275"/> <fo:index-page-citation-list><fo:index-key-reference ref-index-key="doc:image" page-number-treatment="link" color="#1f3a5f"/></fo:index-page-citation-list></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="8pt" start-indent="4mm" end-indent="40mm" text-align-last="justify" keep-with-previous.within-page="always">Indexes <fo:leader leader-pattern="dots" leader-pattern-width="3pt" color="#6b7275"/> <fo:index-page-citation-list><fo:index-key-reference ref-index-key="doc:index" page-number-treatment="link" color="#1f3a5f"/></fo:index-page-citation-list></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="8pt" start-indent="4mm" end-indent="40mm" text-align-last="justify" keep-with-previous.within-page="always">Leaders <fo:leader leader-pattern="dots" leader-pattern-width="3pt" color="#6b7275"/> <fo:index-page-citation-list><fo:index-key-reference ref-index-key="doc:leader" page-number-treatment="link" color="#1f3a5f"/></fo:index-page-citation-list></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="8pt" start-indent="4mm" end-indent="40mm" text-align-last="justify" keep-with-previous.within-page="always">Page numbers <fo:leader leader-pattern="dots" leader-pattern-width="3pt" color="#6b7275"/> <fo:index-page-citation-list><fo:index-key-reference ref-index-key="doc:page-number" page-number-treatment="link" color="#1f3a5f"/></fo:index-page-citation-list></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="8pt" start-indent="4mm" end-indent="40mm" text-align-last="justify" keep-with-previous.within-page="always">Tables (chapter 6) <fo:leader leader-pattern="dots" leader-pattern-width="3pt" color="#6b7275"/> <fo:index-page-citation-list><fo:index-key-reference ref-index-key="doc:table" page-number-treatment="link" color="#1f3a5f"/></fo:index-page-citation-list></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="3mm">The sample below puts keys on words in a paragraph and typesets two index entries under it (the sample is self-contained, so the numbers are this page).</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="index" mark="index-key=&quot;page&quot;|index-key=&quot;ruby&quot;|&lt;fo:index-page-citation-list&gt;|ref-index-key|&lt;fo:index-page-number-prefix&gt;"?>
<fo:block>Typesetting starts from the <fo:inline index-key="page">type
  area</fo:inline>. <fo:index-range-begin id="ix-ruby"
    index-key="ruby"/>Ruby is set small beside its base text.<fo:index-range-end
    ref-id="ix-ruby"/></fo:block>
<fo:block space-before="2mm" text-align-last="justify">Type area <fo:leader
    leader-pattern="dots"/> <fo:index-page-citation-list>
    <fo:index-key-reference ref-index-key="page" font-weight="bold"/>
  </fo:index-page-citation-list></fo:block>
<fo:block text-align-last="justify">Ruby <fo:leader
    leader-pattern="dots"/> <fo:index-page-citation-list>
    <fo:index-key-reference ref-index-key="ruby" page-number-treatment="link">
      <fo:index-page-number-prefix>p. </fo:index-page-number-prefix>
    </fo:index-key-reference>
  </fo:index-page-citation-list></fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <!-- ──────────────── 5 Characters and lines -->
      <fo:block id="ch-text" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">Text and Lines</fo:marker><!--tab:5--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="60.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">5</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="60.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">5</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">5</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">Text and Lines</fo:block></fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-5-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">5.1 </fo:inline>Font properties (font-family, font-size, font-weight, font-style)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">font-family accepts a list of font names and generic families (serif, sans-serif, monospace). From that list Kumiori picks a single font: either a loaded font, or a Mincho (serif), Gothic (sans-serif) or monospace font recognized from the name. Characters missing from that font are typeset in Kumiori's default font (it does not fall through to the fonts later in the list). font-style="italic" slants the glyphs when no italic font is available. Bold Japanese characters in Mincho (serif, or no family specified) are typeset in Noto Sans JP Bold (Gothic), which has a bold weight. When no bold font exists, as with monospace Japanese characters, the glyph outlines are thickened.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">font-variant="small-caps" (XSL 1.1 §7.9.8) sets lowercase letters in small capitals. If the font has small-capital glyphs (OpenType smcp) they are used; otherwise lowercase letters are replaced by uppercase letters at 0.7 times the size (in vertical writing, the scaled uppercase letters are always used). Characters without case (kanji, kana) are unchanged.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">The shorthand font (XSL 1.1 §7.31.13) is split into font-style, font-variant, font-weight, font-size, line-height and font-family. The parts that are not written (and font-stretch) are reset to their initial values. When an individual property is also written, the individual property is used (§5.2). The values that name system fonts (caption, icon, menu, message-box, small-caption, status-bar) are not supported (a warning at load time reports them).</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">When a variable font is supplied (OpenType Font Variations: one file with axes such as weight and width; with TrueType outlines or CFF2 outlines) — as a font passed with the document, with --font of the Node command, or with the fonts option of the API — the value of font-weight becomes the weight axis (wght) and the value of font-stretch becomes the width axis (wdth). A value outside the range of the font becomes the nearer end of the range. Bold text uses the bold shapes of the font instead of thickened outlines. For a font with a width axis, font-stretch does not scale the glyphs. font-style italic and oblique use the italic axis (ital) or the slant axis (slnt) when the font has one. The optical size axis (opsz) receives the font size in pt. A PDF cannot embed a variable font as it is, so each combination of axis values in use is embedded as a static font (two fonts when the regular and the bold are used). A variable font with CFF2 outlines is rebuilt as a static CFF font for every shape, including the default instance (the shapes do not change; the hints are not carried over). In font-family, write the family name of the font (nameID 16 of the name table, such as "Noto Sans JP"). For a variable font without outline variations, and for a CFF2 variable font whose glyphs cannot be read, a warning is reported and the default instance is used.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">A variation selector (U+FE00 to U+FE0F, U+E0100 to U+E01EF) is typeset as one character together with the character before it, and the glyph of the variation sequence is taken from the font (cmap Format 14 of OpenType; IVS and SVS, such as 葛 followed by U+E0100). If the font does not have the sequence, the glyph of the base character is used. Line-breaking rules, letter spacing and the orientation in vertical writing follow the base character.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">A base character followed by combining marks (e with U+0301, か with the combining voiced sound mark U+3099, and so on) and emoji sequences (skin-tone modifiers, ZWJ sequences, flags, keycaps) are also set as one character (an extended grapheme cluster of UAX #29). A sequence whose base is a Latin, Greek or Cyrillic letter is set with the precomposed character (NFC) when the font has it (Vietnamese and polytonic Greek written in decomposed form get the same glyph and width as the precomposed form; CSS Fonts 4 §5.3). Other sequences are passed whole to a single font, so the font's mark positioning (GPOS) and glyph substitution (GSUB) apply. No line break, letter-spacing or justification space is inserted inside a sequence. If no font has the sequence, it is replaced by the precomposed character (NFC) where there is one, and otherwise set with the glyph of each character.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">When a font with colored glyphs is supplied (a color emoji font, for example; the OpenType COLR and CPAL (versions 0 and 1), CBDT and CBLC, sbix and SVG tables), the text is typeset in color. A sequence with U+FE0F (emoji presentation) after the character is set in a color font, and a sequence with U+FE0E (text presentation) is set in a font without colored glyphs (when one of the supplied fonts has the character; UTS #51). The parts of a glyph that are painted in the text color take the value of color. In the PDF the characters are written as a Type 3 font, so the extracted text is the original emoji and each glyph is defined once in the document. XSL-FO has no property for choosing a color palette, so the font's default palette is used. The coverage and limitations of each format are described in section 5.7 of the HTML and CSS volume.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Thai, languages written in Devanagari (Hindi and others) and Korean (Hangul) can be typeset. The default fonts do not have these characters, so pass a font that has them (Noto Sans Thai, Noto Sans Devanagari, Noto Sans KR and so on) with --font of the Node command or fonts of the API, and name it in font-family. Devanagari is set with the glyphs produced by the font's shaping (conjuncts, reph, pre-base vowel signs, nukta, and switching forms with ZWJ and ZWNJ). For Thai, vowels and tone marks above and below are stacked with the font's positioning, and the ring of SARA AM (U+0E33) is reordered below the tone mark. For Hangul, besides syllable characters, a sequence of conjoining jamo (U+1100 and up) is set as one character with the glyph the font composes. Thai, which has no spaces between words, wraps at the word boundaries found with the dictionary of Intl.Segmenter of the runtime (SA of UAX #14, CSS Text 3 §5). Word boundaries can differ between runtimes (ICU versions), and where Intl.Segmenter is missing, lines do not wrap at word boundaries. Korean wraps between syllables as well. The space between Hangul words takes the width the font chooses by context (OpenType calt). No spacing between Japanese and Latin text (axf:text-autospace) is inserted between Hangul and Latin letters or digits. In PDF, characters whose glyphs do not correspond one to one to their characters carry the original characters (ActualText), so text can be extracted.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Limitations: glyphs are obtained from the font one character (grapheme cluster) at a time, so font processing across characters does not apply, apart from pair kerning of Latin and Thai letters, Latin ligatures and the space between Hangul (for example, the Thai ligature of U+0E24 and U+0E45). No dotted circle (U+25CC) is supplied for invalid sequences (a mark without a base, a vowel sign after an independent vowel). Justification stretches only spaces in Thai and Devanagari (a Thai line without spaces is not stretched). In vertical writing, Thai and Devanagari are set sideways and Hangul upright.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Other Indic scripts (Bengali (Bengali, Assamese), Gurmukhi (Punjabi), Gujarati, Oriya, Tamil, Telugu, Kannada, Malayalam and Sinhala) can also be typeset when a font for the script is specified (checked with the Noto Sans and Noto Serif fonts of each script). Conjuncts, reph, vowel signs placed before, above, below or on both sides of the consonant, nukta, anusvara and similar signs, the switching of conjunct forms with ZWJ and ZWNJ, Malayalam chillu letters, Tamil ligatures, the subjoined consonants of Telugu and Kannada, and the Sinhala rakaransaya, yansaya and repaya are set with the glyphs produced by the font's shaping. A conjunct is one unit of text: no line break, letter spacing or justification space falls inside it. Scripts whose conjuncts the default rules of Unicode (UAX #29) do not keep together (Gurmukhi, Kannada, the two Tamil sequences that form ligatures, Sinhala sequences with ZWJ) are also treated as one unit (the tailoring for syllables in UAX #29 §3, CSS Text 3 §1.4). Words wrap at spaces, and the font's kerning between syllables (kern, dist) is applied. A Bengali vowel sign placed before the consonant does not take the word-initial form in a syllable inside a word. In vertical writing these scripts are set sideways. Text extracted from the PDF is the original character sequence.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Lao, Khmer, Burmese (Myanmar script, including the letters for Shan and Mon) and Tibetan can also be typeset when a font for the script is specified (checked with Lao, Khmer and Myanmar of Noto Sans and Noto Serif, and Noto Serif Tibetan). Vowel signs placed before the consonant, subjoined consonants, stacks, kinzi and tone marks are set with the font's glyphs. Lao, Khmer and Burmese text written without spaces wraps at the word boundaries found by the runtime's Intl.Segmenter (word boundaries can differ between runtimes); it also wraps at a zero width space (U+200B). Tibetan wraps after a tsek (the dot that separates syllables). In Myanmar script a syllable, and in Lao a vowel placed before the consonant together with that consonant, is one unit of text: no line break, letter spacing or justification space falls inside it. These fonts are tall, so a larger line-height should be specified. With the default line-height of XSL-FO (1.2), lines of Myanmar and Tibetan script overlap, so a larger value should be specified. Mongolian script (checked with Noto Sans Mongolian) can be set in horizontal and vertical writing (writing-mode: vertical-lr, vertical-rl) with the letters of a word joined. Free variation selectors (U+180B to U+180D), the vowel separator (U+180E) and the narrow no-break space before suffixes (U+202F) are handled. Text extracted from the PDF is the original character sequence.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Limitations for these scripts: glyphs are obtained from the font one unit of text at a time, so font rules that change a glyph according to the neighbouring units have no effect (for example, in Noto Serif Bengali the vowel sign AA inside a word takes the word-final form). The word-initial forms of Bengali are distinguished in horizontal writing only, and a syllable that follows a change of formatting inside a word takes the initial form. New characters that the shaping library does not know (such as the Telugu nukta added in Unicode 14) and rare sequences may get a dotted circle or fail to form a conjunct. Some contextual rules of Mongolian fonts are not applied. No inter-script spacing is inserted between Japanese text and these scripts.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Arabic script (Arabic, Persian) and Hebrew script can be typeset from right to left. The default fonts do not have Arabic letters, so pass a font that has them (Noto Sans Arabic, Noto Naskh Arabic and so on) with --font of the Node command or fonts of the API, and select it with font-family. Hebrew can also be typeset with the default Latin fonts (Tinos, Arimo), including text with vowel points (niqqud) and cantillation marks (a font such as Noto Sans Hebrew or Noto Serif Hebrew can be specified as well). The order of characters is decided by the Unicode Bidirectional Algorithm (UAX #9; reordering is done per line) and follows writing-mode="rl-tb", direction and fo:bidi-override (unicode-bidi). The start side of a paragraph (start-indent, text-indent, start and end of text-align), the side of list labels and the order of table columns also run from right to left. Arabic words (separated by spaces) are passed whole to the font, which selects initial, medial, final and isolated forms and the required ligatures (such as lam-alef). Joining is kept across inline boundaries that only change the color (CSS Text 3 §7.3). Arabic combining marks such as vowel signs are stacked in the order of Unicode UTR #53 (a vowel sign above a shadda), and Hebrew points are passed to the font with the dagesh and the shin and sin dots before the vowel points (fonts that have glyphs combining a consonant with a dagesh or shin dot then use them; the same order as HarfBuzz). In both cases the reordering applies only to what is passed to the font; text extracted from the PDF keeps the original order. The zero-width non-joiner (U+200C, used in Persian) does not split a word; it makes the neighboring letters take their non-joining forms. Invisible control characters such as LRM and RLM have no width. Justification widens only the spaces between words, and letter-spacing is not inserted inside Arabic words (CSS Text 3 §6.4.4 and §7.2.1; it is inserted between Hebrew letters). In vertical writing both scripts are set sideways and run from the bottom of the line to the top. Arabic is joined as a sideways word, and with text-orientation: upright each letter is set in its isolated form (CSS Writing Modes 3 §5.1.1). In the PDF each word (for Hebrew, each letter with vowel points) carries its characters as ActualText, so text can be extracted in reading order (checked with poppler; the characters are written in the order placed on the page, left to right).</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Limitations: no line break is made inside an Arabic word (even with word-break: break-all or overflow-wrap: anywhere the word moves to the next line as a whole, and a word longer than the line overflows). The order of letters inside an Arabic word does not change with unicode-bidi: bidi-override (only the position of the word changes). Justification by elongation (kashida) is not done. When a right-to-left title, Latin text, a leader and a number follow one another, as in a table-of-contents line, the number is placed next to the Latin text as UAX #9 specifies (wrapping the title in bdi or fo:bidi-override avoids this). Other right-to-left scripts such as Syriac, Thaana and N'Ko have not been checked.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Vietnamese, Greek (including polytonic) and languages written in Cyrillic such as Russian and Ukrainian can be typeset with the default Latin fonts (Tinos, Arimo), including bold, italic and pair kerning. Vietnamese letters (Latin Extended Additional) are set in the same Latin font as the rest of the word and take part in the spacing between Japanese and Latin text. In a Japanese document (with a generic or default font, which is a pair of a Japanese font and a Latin font), a word of two or more Greek or Cyrillic letters is set in the Latin font like a Latin word, and the Japanese-Latin spacing is inserted between it and Japanese characters (a word joined by a hyphen or apostrophe is one word; Latin letters, digits, Japanese characters and spaces end a word). A single letter (such as a Greek letter used as a unit or symbol) is set in the Japanese font when that font has it, without the spacing. Words are found within one text string, so a word that crosses an inline element boundary is cut at the boundary. With the Antenna House compatibility setting (--compat antenna), words also stay in the Japanese font. Hyphenation (hyphenate="true") is done for text whose language is ru (Russian), uk (Ukrainian) or el (Modern Greek, monotonic spelling). Vietnamese, polytonic Greek (el-polyton) and Ancient Greek (grc) are not hyphenated.</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-5-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">font-family</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.9.2)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;family-name&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The name of the font family to use. The list is searched from the start for a font that has the character.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: if the name matches no loaded font, Mincho, Gothic or monospace is recognized from the name and a built-in font is used</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;generic-family&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A generic font family name (serif, sans-serif, cursive, fantasy, monospace).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: serif, sans-serif and monospace are recognized; cursive and fantasy are not</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">font-size</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.9.4)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;absolute-size&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>An entry (xx-small to xx-large) in the formatter's table of font sizes. A ratio of 1.2 between adjacent entries is recommended.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;relative-size&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>One step up (larger) or down (smaller) in the table from the parent's font size.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Sets the font size to the given length.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A percentage of the parent's font size.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">font-weight</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.9.9)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Same as 400.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">bold</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Same as 700.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">bolder</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>One step bolder than the inherited weight.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: becomes bold regardless of the parent's weight</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">lighter</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>One step lighter than the inherited weight.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: becomes normal regardless of the parent's weight</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">100–900</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The weight as a number. A larger number selects a font that is at least as bold.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: values of 600 and above select the bold font, smaller values the regular weight</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">font-style</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.9.7)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Uses the normal (upright) font.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">italic</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Uses the italic font, or the oblique font if there is none.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">oblique</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Uses the oblique (slanted) font.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: treated the same as italic</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">backslant</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Uses a backslanted font.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-5-1-->
<?kumiori-sample id="fonts" mark="font-family=&quot;serif&quot;|font-family=&quot;sans-serif&quot;|font-family=&quot;monospace&quot;|font-size=&quot;14pt&quot;|font-weight=&quot;bold&quot;|font-style=&quot;italic&quot;"?>
<fo:block font-family="serif">明朝体 (serif) の段落。Serif の欧文。</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif">ゴシック体 (sans-serif) の段落。Sans-serif.</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="monospace">等幅 (monospace): if (a &lt; b) return;</fo:block>
<fo:block font-size="14pt" font-weight="bold">14pt の太字</fo:block>
<fo:block font-style="italic">斜体 (italic) の Italic text</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">The following sample is set with the color emoji font Noto Color Emoji (COLR version 1; of the WOFF2 files that Google Fonts serves split by character range, the one with the face and hand emoji), passed with --font of the Node command. XSL-FO has no way to point at a font file, so fonts are passed from outside the document, and font-family names the font family. The code of the sample writes emoji as numeric character references. When the emoji font has no space character, write the emoji without spaces between them.</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="emoji" mark="font-family=&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;"?>
<fo:block>色の付いた絵文字 <fo:inline font-family="Noto Color Emoji" font-size="14pt">&#x1F600;&#x1F642;&#x1F44D;&#x1F44D;&#x1F3FD;&#x1F44B;&#x1F3FF;&#x263A;&#xFE0F;&#x270C;&#xFE0F;</fo:inline></fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">The following sample is set with the variable font Roboto Flex (weight wght 100–1000, width wdth 25–151, slant slnt -10–0, optical size opsz 8–144), passed with --font. The values of font-weight, font-stretch and font-style become the values of the weight, width and slant axes.</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="variable-font" mark="font-family=&quot;Roboto Flex&quot;|font-weight=&quot;100&quot;|font-weight=&quot;900&quot;|font-stretch=&quot;25%&quot;|font-stretch=&quot;151%&quot;|font-style=&quot;italic&quot;"?>
<fo:block font-family="Roboto Flex" font-size="12pt" line-height="1.5" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-weight="100">Aa100</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-weight="200">Aa200</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-weight="300">Aa300</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-weight="400">Aa400</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-weight="500">Aa500</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-weight="600">Aa600</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-weight="700">Aa700</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-weight="800">Aa800</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-weight="900">Aa900</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="Roboto Flex" font-size="12pt" line-height="1.5" text-align="start"><fo:inline font-stretch="25%">Width 25%</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-stretch="100%">Width 100%</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-stretch="151%">Width 151%</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-style="italic">italic</fo:inline></fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-5-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">5.2 </fo:inline>text-align and text-align-last<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Value</fo:inline> : start | center | end | justify | inside | outside | left | right | &lt;string&gt; | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : start　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(text-align — XSL 1.1 §7.16.9)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Value</fo:inline> : relative | start | center | end | justify | inside | outside | left | right | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : relative　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(text-align-last — XSL 1.1 §7.16.10)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“relative: If text-align is justify, then the alignment of the last line, and of any line ending in U+000A, will be start.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.16.10</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Justification of Japanese text follows the line adjustment rules of JLREQ (§3.8): punctuation spacing is compressed first, and only if that is not enough are the spaces between characters widened. Line-start and line-end kinsoku rules (no punctuation or closing brackets at the start of a line) are also observed.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">last-line-end-indent (XSL 1.1 §7.16.3) moves the end edge of the last line of a block (and of a line that ends before a child block) inward for positive values and outward for negative values. It is inherited, and percentages refer to the width of the area containing the block. When the remaining content fits in one line of the shifted width, that line is set as the last line (with a negative value, content that does not fit the normal width can still go on the last line; with a positive value, content that fits the normal width but not the shifted width is broken earlier). The alignment of text-align-last is made against the shifted edge. It is not applied to lines that end with a forced line break.</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-5-2--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">text-align</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.16.9)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">start</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Aligns the content to the start edge in the inline-progression direction.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">center</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Centers the content in the inline-progression direction.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Aligns the content to the end edge in the inline-progression direction.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">justify</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Spreads the content to fill the available width (justification).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">inside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Aligns to start if the binding edge of the page is the start edge, to end if it is the end edge; otherwise start.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: odd pages are treated as bound on the start edge and even pages on the end edge (the same in compatibility mode); in vertical lines the binding edge is not along the line, so on every page inside is start and outside is end</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">outside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Aligns to end if the binding edge of the page is the start edge, to start if it is the end edge; otherwise end.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: odd pages are treated as bound on the start edge and even pages on the end edge (the same in compatibility mode); in vertical lines the binding edge is not along the line, so on every page inside is start and outside is end</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">left</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Treated as text-align="start".</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (in compatibility mode, aligns to the physical left or right)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">right</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Treated as text-align="end".</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (in compatibility mode, aligns to the physical left or right)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;string&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Aligns the contents of table cells in a column on the position of that string. Outside a table cell, treated as start.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">text-align-last</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.16.10)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">relative</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>If text-align is justify, the last line (and any line ending in a U+000A linefeed) is aligned to start; otherwise the same as text-align.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">start</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Aligns the last line to the start edge.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">center</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Centers the last line.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Aligns the last line to the end edge.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">justify</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Spreads the last line too across the full available width.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">inside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Aligns to start if the binding edge of the page is the start edge, to end if it is the end edge; otherwise start.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: in spec mode, decided by the binding edge (start edge on odd pages, end edge on even pages; in vertical lines, inside is start and outside is end on every page); in compatibility mode, always start</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">outside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Aligns to end if the binding edge of the page is the start edge, to start if it is the end edge; otherwise end.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: in spec mode, decided by the binding edge (start edge on odd pages, end edge on even pages; in vertical lines, inside is start and outside is end on every page); in compatibility mode, always start</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">left</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Treated as text-align-last="start".</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (in compatibility mode, aligns to the physical left or right)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">right</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Treated as text-align-last="end".</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (in compatibility mode, aligns to the physical left or right)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-5-2-->
<?kumiori-sample id="align" mark="text-align=&quot;justify&quot;|text-align=&quot;center&quot;|text-align=&quot;end&quot;|text-align-last=&quot;justify&quot;"?>
<fo:block text-align="justify" border="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3" padding="3pt">両端そろえ
  (justify) の段落です。行の終わりがそろうように、字の間を調整します。最後の行は
  text-align-last の初期値 relative により、行頭にそろいます。</fo:block>
<fo:block text-align="center" space-before="3pt">中央そろえ (center)</fo:block>
<fo:block text-align="end">行末そろえ (end)</fo:block>
<fo:block text-align="justify" text-align-last="justify"
    space-before="3pt">最後の行も両端にそろえる</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-5-3" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">5.3 </fo:inline>letter-spacing and line-height<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Value</fo:inline> : normal | &lt;length&gt; | &lt;space&gt; | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : normal　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(letter-spacing — XSL 1.1 §7.17.2)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Value</fo:inline> : normal | &lt;length&gt; | &lt;number&gt; | &lt;percentage&gt; | &lt;space&gt; | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : normal　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(line-height — XSL 1.1 §7.16.4)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“This property specifies spacing behavior between text characters.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.17.2</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">A length in word-spacing (XSL 1.1 §7.17.8) is added to the width of inter-word spaces (U+0020, U+00A0 and so on). When it is written as a &lt;space&gt;, the .optimum value is used and the .minimum / .maximum range is not (stretching and shrinking of a line is decided by justification).</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-5-3--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">letter-spacing</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.17.2)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The font's normal letter spacing. The formatter may alter the spacing for justification.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Adds the given length to the normal letter spacing. The spacing is not altered further for justification.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;space&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the minimum, optimum and maximum spacing to add; the spacing may be adjusted within that range.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: only .optimum and .maximum are used</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">line-height</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.16.4)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A "reasonable" value chosen by the formatter from the font size. The spec recommends 1.0 to 1.2.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Sets the line height to the given length.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;number&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The element's font size multiplied by the number. Children inherit the number itself.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The element's font size multiplied by the percentage.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;space&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the minimum, optimum and maximum line height together with conditionality and precedence (used to determine the half-leading).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-5-3-->
<?kumiori-sample id="spacing" mark="letter-spacing=&quot;0.3em&quot;|line-height=&quot;1.2&quot;|line-height=&quot;2.2&quot;"?>
<fo:block letter-spacing="0.3em">字と字の間を広く空けた行です</fo:block>
<fo:block line-height="1.2" space-before="3pt" background-color="#eef2f8"
    margin-right="50mm">行と行の間が詰まる、行送り 1.2
  の段落です。二行目を見ると、行の間の違いが分かります。</fo:block>
<fo:block line-height="2.2" space-before="3pt" background-color="#fdf3e2"
    margin-right="50mm">行と行の間が広がる、行送り 2.2
  の段落です。二行目を見ると、行の間の違いが分かります。</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-5-4" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">5.4 </fo:inline>hyphenate (hyphenation of Latin text)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Value</fo:inline> : false | true | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : false　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(hyphenate — XSL 1.1 §7.10.4)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“true: Hyphenation may be used in the line-breaking algorithm between characters with this value.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.10.4</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Hyphenation rules are selected by language (xml:lang). Kumiori has rules for English (en-US, en-GB), Latin (la), Russian (ru), Ukrainian (uk) and Modern Greek (el, monotonic spelling). Words in Cyrillic letters are broken in Russian and Ukrainian text, and words in Greek letters in Modern Greek text. Words in other languages are not hyphenated. When country (§7.10.1) is given, the rules are selected by language and country together (language="en" country="GB" selects British rules, the same as xml:lang="en-GB"). script (§7.10.3) is not used to select rules.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Hyphenation limits can also be specified (all are inherited, and they work the same way in vertical writing). hyphenation-character (§7.10.5) is the character shown at the end of a hyphenated line. When it is not specified, the initial value in the specification, U+2010 (hyphen), is shown (U+002D in the antenna compatibility mode; appendix B). The glyph is taken from the same Latin font as the letters of the word (or, if that font lacks it, from a font that has it). The same character is shown on lines broken at a soft hyphen (U+00AD). hyphenation-remain-character-count (§7.10.7) is the minimum number of characters before the break (left on the line), and hyphenation-push-character-count (§7.10.6) the minimum after the break (pushed to the next line); both are initially 2, and words shorter than 5 characters are not hyphenated. hyphenation-ladder-count (§7.16.2) is the maximum number of successive lines that may end with a hyphen (initially no-limit). A line over the limit is not hyphenated; the word is sent to the next line. When a line holds a single word and has no other place to wrap, it is hyphenated even over the limit. The values column and page of hyphenation-keep (§7.16.1) are not interpreted (chapter 13).</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-5-4--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">hyphenate</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.10.4)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">false</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>No hyphenation is performed in line breaking.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">true</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Hyphenation may be used in line breaking.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: only English (en, en-US, en-GB), Latin (la), Russian (ru), Ukrainian (uk) and Modern Greek (el) rules are available</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-5-4-->
<?kumiori-sample id="hyphenate" mark="hyphenate=&quot;true&quot;|xml:lang=&quot;en&quot;"?>
<fo:block xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true" text-align="justify" width="60mm"
    margin-right="60mm" font-family="serif">
  Typesetting engines must balance typographic considerations such as
  justification, hyphenation, and internationalization requirements.
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-5-5" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">5.5 </fo:inline>linefeed-treatment and white-space handling<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Value</fo:inline> : ignore | preserve | treat-as-space | treat-as-zero-width-space | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : treat-as-space　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(linefeed-treatment — XSL 1.1 §7.16.7)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“ignore: Specifies that any character flow object whose Unicode code point is U+000A shall be discarded during the refinement process.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.16.7</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">The sample code shown in this document uses linefeed-treatment="preserve" and white-space-collapse="false" to keep the line breaks and indentation of the source as they are.</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-5-5--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">linefeed-treatment</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.16.7)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ignore</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Discards linefeeds (U+000A).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">preserve</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Leaves linefeeds untouched (they remain as line breaks).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">treat-as-space</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Converts linefeeds to spaces (U+0020).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">treat-as-zero-width-space</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Converts linefeeds to zero-width spaces (U+200B). They become line-break opportunities but add no space within a line.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">white-space-treatment</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.16.8)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ignore</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Removes XML white space other than linefeeds (U+000A) when laying out lines.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">preserve</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Does not remove XML white space.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ignore-if-before-linefeed</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Removes discardable white space that would end a line.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ignore-if-after-linefeed</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Removes discardable white space that would start a line.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">ignore-if-surrounding-linefeed</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Removes discardable white space that would start or end a line.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">white-space-collapse</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.16.12)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">false</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Leaves white space untouched (runs of spaces are kept as they are).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">true</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A space immediately preceded by another space or immediately followed by a linefeed is not output (runs of spaces collapse to one).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">white-space</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.31.23)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Shorthand for linefeed-treatment="treat-as-space", white-space-collapse="true", white-space-treatment="ignore-if-surrounding-linefeed" and wrap-option="wrap".</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">pre</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Shorthand for linefeed-treatment="preserve", white-space-collapse="false", white-space-treatment="preserve" and wrap-option="no-wrap".</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">nowrap</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Shorthand for the same white-space handling as normal, with wrap-option="no-wrap".</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-5-5-->
<?kumiori-sample id="linefeed" mark="linefeed-treatment=&quot;preserve&quot;|white-space-collapse=&quot;false&quot;|white-space-treatment=&quot;preserve&quot;"?>
<fo:block linefeed-treatment="preserve" white-space-collapse="false"
    white-space-treatment="preserve" font-family="monospace" font-size="8pt"
    background-color="#f5f1e8" padding="3pt">一行目
    四つ下げた二行目
三行目</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-5-6" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">5.6 </fo:inline>Supported languages and scripts</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">The table lists the languages and scripts that have been checked to typeset with Kumiori. Scripts whose Font column says “default” can be typeset without supplying a font. For those that say “required”, the default fonts do not have the characters, so supply a font that has them (<fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="0.92em">--font</fo:inline> of the Node command, <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="0.92em">fonts</fo:inline> of the API) and specify it with <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="0.92em">font-family</fo:inline>. The fonts in parentheses are the ones the script was checked with.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">Each script in the table was typeset with that font, and the glyphs (the font's shaping), line wrapping and the text extracted from the PDF were checked. For every script, text extracted from the PDF is the original character sequence (in reading order for right-to-left scripts). The details of how each script is set, and the limitations that do not fit in the table, are in the second half of section 5.1.</fo:block>
<fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"><fo:table-column column-width="24mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="28mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="18mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="36mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Language, script</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Font</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Line wrapping and typesetting</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Vertical writing</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Limitations and notes</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start">
<fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Japanese</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Default (Noto Serif JP, Noto Sans JP)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Wraps between characters. Line-breaking rules and punctuation trimming (5.2), spacing between Japanese and Latin text (Appendix A.3), hanging punctuation (Appendix A.4).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Upright (3.2)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Described in each section.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
<fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Chinese (Simplified, Traditional)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Required (Noto Sans SC and TC, Noto Serif SC and TC). The default Japanese fonts lack the characters used only in Simplified Chinese.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Wraps between characters. How punctuation and colons are trimmed (Appendix A.3) is decided from the position of the glyph in the font.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Upright. Punctuation follows the font's vertical glyphs.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Chinese typesetting was checked mainly with HTML and CSS input (see the HTML and CSS volume).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
<fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Korean (Hangul)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Required (Noto Sans KR)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Wraps between syllables as well. A sequence of conjoining jamo (U+1100 and up) is composed into one character.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Upright</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>No inter-script spacing is inserted between Hangul and Latin letters or digits.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
<fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Latin script (English, Vietnamese and others)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Default (Tinos, Arimo; monospace is Cousine)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Wraps at spaces. Hyphenation for English and Latin (5.4). Characters written in decomposed form (NFD) are set the same as the precomposed ones.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Sideways</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Words of other languages, such as Vietnamese, are not hyphenated.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
<fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Greek script (including polytonic)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Default (Tinos, Arimo)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Wraps at spaces. Hyphenation for Modern Greek (el, monotonic spelling). In a Japanese document, a word of two or more letters is set in the Latin font.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Sideways</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Polytonic Greek (el-polyton) and Ancient Greek (grc) are not hyphenated.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
<fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Cyrillic script (Russian, Ukrainian and others)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Default (Tinos, Arimo)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Wraps at spaces. Hyphenation for Russian (ru) and Ukrainian (uk). Words in a Japanese document are handled as for Greek.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Sideways</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Words of other languages are not hyphenated.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
<fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Hebrew script</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Default (Tinos, Arimo). Noto Sans Hebrew and Noto Serif Hebrew can also be specified.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Set from right to left (UAX #9). Text with vowel points (niqqud) and cantillation marks can also be typeset.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Sideways, running from the bottom of the line to the top.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>When a right-to-left title, Latin text, a leader and a number follow one another, as in a table-of-contents line, the number is placed next to the Latin text (as UAX #9 specifies).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
<fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Arabic script (Arabic, Persian)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Required (Noto Sans Arabic, Noto Naskh Arabic)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Set from right to left. Words separated by spaces are passed whole to the font, which gives the joining forms and the required ligatures.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Set as joined sideways words (when set upright, each letter takes its isolated form).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>No line break is made inside a word (a word longer than the line overflows). Justification by elongation (kashida) is not done.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
<fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Devanagari (Hindi and others)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Required (Noto Sans Devanagari)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Wraps at spaces. A conjunct is one character, and no line break falls inside it.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Sideways</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Font processing across characters does not apply. No dotted circle (U+25CC) is supplied for invalid sequences.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
<fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Bengali (Bengali, Assamese), Gurmukhi (Punjabi), Gujarati, Oriya, Tamil, Telugu, Kannada, Malayalam, Sinhala</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Required (the Noto Sans and Noto Serif fonts of each script)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Wraps at spaces. A conjunct is one unit of text, and no line break falls inside it.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Sideways</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Font rules that change a glyph according to the neighbouring units have no effect. New characters (such as the Telugu nukta added in Unicode 14) and rare sequences may get a dotted circle.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
<fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Thai script (Thai)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Required (Noto Sans Thai)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Wraps at word boundaries (the dictionary of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="0.92em">Intl.Segmenter</fo:inline> of the runtime) and at spaces.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Sideways</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Word boundaries can differ between runtimes (ICU versions). Where <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="0.92em">Intl.Segmenter</fo:inline> is missing, lines do not wrap at word boundaries. A line without spaces is not stretched by justification.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
<fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Lao, Khmer, Myanmar script (Burmese; including the letters for Shan and Mon)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Required (Lao, Khmer and Myanmar of Noto Sans and Noto Serif)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Wraps at word boundaries (<fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="0.92em">Intl.Segmenter</fo:inline>), at spaces and at a zero width space (U+200B).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Not checked.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Word boundaries can differ between runtimes. These fonts are tall, so specify a larger line height.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
<fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Tibetan script</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Required (Noto Serif Tibetan)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Wraps after a tsek (the dot that separates syllables).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Not checked.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The font is tall, so specify a larger line height.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
<fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Mongolian script</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Required (Noto Sans Mongolian)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A word is one unit of text, with its letters joined (no line break falls inside a word).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>In vertical writing too, words are set joined (letters sideways).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Some contextual rules of the font are not applied.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
<fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Emoji</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Required (a color font such as Noto Color Emoji, or a monochrome outline font such as Noto Emoji)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>An emoji sequence (skin-tone modifiers, ZWJ sequences, flags, keycaps) is one character, and no line break falls inside it.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Upright</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Color emoji fonts (Noto Color Emoji and the like; COLR, CBDT, sbix, SVG) are typeset in color when the font is specified (section 5.1; the coverage of each format is in section 5.7 of the HTML and CSS volume). A character followed by U+FE0F is set in a color font, and one followed by U+FE0E in a font without colored glyphs.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
<fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Other scripts (right-to-left scripts such as Syriac, Thaana and N'Ko, Tai Lue and so on)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2" number-columns-spanned="4"><fo:block>Not checked.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
</fo:table-body></fo:table>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="1.5mm" start-indent="1.2em" text-indent="-1.2em" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#b08132">※ </fo:inline>Hyphenation (<fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="0.92em">hyphenate="true"</fo:inline>) has rules for English (en, en-US, en-GB), Latin (la), Russian (ru), Ukrainian (uk) and Modern Greek (el, monotonic spelling). Words of other languages are not hyphenated (5.4).</fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="1.5mm" start-indent="1.2em" text-indent="-1.2em" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#b08132">※ </fo:inline>Variable fonts (fonts that hold axes such as weight in one file) can be used, with either TrueType outlines or CFF2 outlines (variable OTF fonts). <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="0.92em">font-weight</fo:inline> sets the weight axis and <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="0.92em">font-stretch</fo:inline> the width axis (section 5.1).</fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="1.5mm" start-indent="1.2em" text-indent="-1.2em" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#b08132">※ </fo:inline>The glyphs and positions of Thai, Lao, Khmer, Myanmar, Tibetan and Mongolian script, the Indic scripts other than Devanagari, and Arabic and Hebrew script were compared with the result of shaping the same fonts with HarfBuzz.</fo:block>
      <fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="8.8pt" color="#23313a" space-before="4mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always">Samples for each script</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">These samples set the scripts of the table, each with its font. The text is Article 1 of the Universal Declaration of Human Rights in each language (the texts collected in “UDHR in Unicode” of the Unicode Consortium). Fonts for scripts that the default fonts lack are passed with --font of the Node command, and font-family names the font family. Section 5.8 of the HTML and CSS volume has samples of more scripts (Gurmukhi, Gujarati, Telugu, Kannada, Malayalam, Sinhala, Lao, Khmer and Myanmar).</fo:block>
      <fo:block space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always">From the top: Japanese (the default fonts), Simplified Chinese (Noto Sans SC), Traditional Chinese (Noto Sans TC) and Korean (Noto Sans KR) :</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="lang-cjk" mark="font-family=&quot;Noto Sans SC&quot;|font-family=&quot;Noto Sans TC&quot;|font-family=&quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;"?>
<fo:block xml:lang="ja" space-after="1.5mm">すべての人間は、生まれながらにして自由であり、かつ、尊厳と権利とについて平等である。人間は、理性と良心とを授けられており、互いに同胞の精神をもって行動しなければならない。</fo:block>
<fo:block xml:lang="zh-Hans" font-family="Noto Sans SC" space-after="1.5mm">人人生而自由，在尊严和权利上一律平等。他们赋有理性和良心，并应以兄弟关系的精神相对待。</fo:block>
<fo:block xml:lang="zh-Hant" font-family="Noto Sans TC" space-after="1.5mm">人人生而自由，在尊嚴和權利上一律平等。他們賦有理性和良心，並應以兄弟關係的精神相對待。</fo:block>
<fo:block xml:lang="ko" font-family="Noto Sans KR" space-after="1.5mm">모든 인간은 태어날 때부터 자유로우며 그 존엄과 권리에 있어 동등하다. 인간은 천부적으로 이성과 양심을 부여받았으며 서로 형제애의 정신으로 행동하여야 한다.</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>
      <fo:block space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always">From the top: Vietnamese, Modern Greek and Russian. hyphenate="true" hyphenates the Greek (xml:lang el) and Russian (ru) words. The font is the default Latin font Tinos, specified by name (with the default font set, one-letter words such as the Russian и and в would be set in the Japanese font) :</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="lang-european" mark="hyphenate=&quot;true&quot;"?>
<fo:block-container width="70mm" font-size="8pt" line-height="1.5" hyphenate="true">
  <fo:block xml:lang="vi" font-family="Tinos" space-after="1.5mm">Tất cả mọi người sinh ra đều được tự do và bình đẳng về nhân phẩm và quyền. Mọi con người đều được tạo hoá ban cho lý trí và lương tâm và cần phải đối xử với nhau trong tình bằng hữu.</fo:block>
  <fo:block xml:lang="el" font-family="Tinos" space-after="1.5mm">Όλοι οι άνθρωποι γεννιούνται ελεύθεροι και ίσοι στην αξιοπρέπεια και τα δικαιώματα. Είναι προικισμένοι με λογική και συνείδηση, και οφείλουν να συμπεριφέρονται μεταξύ τους με πνεύμα αδελφοσύνης.</fo:block>
  <fo:block xml:lang="ru" font-family="Tinos" space-after="1.5mm">Все люди рождаются свободными и равными в своем достоинстве и правах. Они наделены разумом и совестью и должны поступать в отношении друг друга в духе братства.</fo:block>
</fo:block-container>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>
      <fo:block space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always">From the top: Hebrew (Noto Sans Hebrew), Arabic and Persian (Noto Sans Arabic). writing-mode="rl-tb" sets the lines from the right :</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="lang-rtl" mark="writing-mode=&quot;rl-tb&quot;"?>
<fo:block-container writing-mode="rl-tb">
  <fo:block xml:lang="he" font-family="Noto Sans Hebrew" space-after="1.5mm">
כל בני אדם נולדו בני חורין ושווים בערכם ובזכויותיהם. כולם חוננו בתבונה ובמצפון, לפיכך חובה עליהם לנהוג איש ברעהו ברוח של אחוה.
  </fo:block>
  <fo:block xml:lang="ar" font-family="Noto Sans Arabic" space-after="1.5mm">
يولد جميع الناس أحرارًا متساوين في الكرامة والحقوق. وقد وهبوا عقلاً وضميرًا وعليهم أن يعامل بعضهم بعضًا بروح الإخاء.
  </fo:block>
  <fo:block xml:lang="fa" font-family="Noto Sans Arabic" space-after="1.5mm">
تمام افراد بشر آزاد بدنیا میایند و از لحاظ حیثیت و حقوق با هم برابرند. همه دارای عقل و وجدان میباشند و باید نسبت بیکدیگر با روح برادری رفتار کنند.
  </fo:block>
</fo:block-container>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>
      <fo:block space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always">From the top: Hindi (Noto Sans Devanagari), Bengali (Noto Sans Bengali), Tamil (Noto Sans Tamil), Thai (Noto Sans Thai) and Tibetan (Noto Serif Tibetan). Thai is wrapped at word boundaries, and Tibetan after a tsek (the dot that separates syllables) :</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="lang-indic"?>
<fo:block xml:lang="hi" font-family="Noto Sans Devanagari" space-after="1.5mm">सभी मनुष्यों को गौरव और अधिकारों के मामले में जन्मजात स्वतन्त्रता और समानता प्राप्त है । उन्हें बुद्धि और अन्तरात्मा की देन प्राप्त है और परस्पर उन्हें भाईचारे के भाव से बर्ताव करना चाहिए ।</fo:block>
<fo:block xml:lang="bn" font-family="Noto Sans Bengali" space-after="1.5mm">সমস্ত মানুষ স্বাধীনভাবে সমান মর্যাদা এবং অধিকার নিয়ে জন্মগ্রহণ করে। তাঁদের বিবেক এবং বুদ্ধি আছে; সুতরাং সকলেরই একে অপরের প্রতি ভ্রাতৃত্বসুলভ মনোভাব নিয়ে আচরণ করা উচিত।</fo:block>
<fo:block xml:lang="ta" font-family="Noto Sans Tamil" space-after="1.5mm">மனிதப் பிறிவியினர் சகலரும் சுதந்திரமாகவே பிறக்கின்றனர்; அவர்கள் மதிப்பிலும், உரிமைகளிலும் சமமானவர்கள், அவர்கள் நியாயத்தையும் மனச்சாட்சியையும் இயற்பண்பாகப் பெற்றவர்கள். அவர்கள் ஒருவருடனொருவர் சகோதர உணர்வுப் பாங்கில் நடந்துகொள்ளல் வேண்டும்.</fo:block>
<fo:block xml:lang="th" font-family="Noto Sans Thai" line-height="2" space-after="1.5mm">มนุษย์ทั้งปวงเกิดมามีอิสระและเสมอภาคกันในศักดิ์ศรีและสิทธิ ต่างในตนมีเหตุผลและมโนธรรม และควรปฏิบัติต่อกันด้วยจิตวิญญาณแห่งภราดรภาพ</fo:block>
<fo:block xml:lang="bo" font-family="Noto Serif Tibetan" line-height="2" space-after="1.5mm">འགྲོ་བ་མིའི་རིགས་རྒྱུད་ཡོངས་ལ་སྐྱེས་ཙམ་ཉིད་ནས་ཆེ་མཐོངས་དང༌། ཐོབ་ཐངགི་རང་དབང་འདྲ་མཉམ་དུ་ཡོད་ལ། ཁོང་ཚོར་རང་བྱུང་གི་བློ་རྩལ་དང་བསམ་ཚུལ་བཟང་པོ་འདོན་པའི་འོས་བབས་ཀྱང་ཡོད། དེ་བཞིན་ཕན་ཚུན་གཅིག་གིས་གཅིག་ལ་བུ་སྤུན་གྱི་འདུ་ཤེས་འཛིན་པའི་བྱ་སྤྱོད་ཀྱང་ལག་ལེན་བསྟར་དགོས་པ་ཡིན༎</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>
      <fo:block space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always">Mongolian script (Noto Sans Mongolian), in vertical text with writing-mode="tb-lr"; the lines progress from left to right :</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="lang-mongolian" mark="writing-mode=&quot;tb-lr&quot;"?>
<fo:block-container writing-mode="tb-lr" height="42mm" width="100%">
  <fo:block xml:lang="mn-Mong" font-family="Noto Sans Mongolian" line-height="1.6">ᠬᠦᠮᠦᠨ ᠪᠦᠷ ᠲᠥᠷᠥᠵᠦ ᠮᠡᠨᠳᠡᠯᠡᠬᠦ ᠡᠷᠬᠡ ᠴᠢᠯᠥᠭᠡ ᠲᠡᠢ᠂ ᠠᠳᠠᠯᠢᠬᠠᠨ ᠨᠡᠷ᠎ᠡ ᠲᠥᠷᠥ ᠲᠡᠢ᠂ ᠢᠵᠢᠯ ᠡᠷᠬᠡ ᠲᠡᠢ ᠪᠠᠢᠠᠭ᠃ ᠣᠶᠤᠨ ᠤᠬᠠᠭᠠᠨ᠂ ᠨᠠᠨᠳᠢᠨ ᠴᠢᠨᠠᠷ ᠵᠠᠶᠠᠭᠠᠰᠠᠨ ᠬᠦᠮᠦᠨ ᠬᠡᠭᠴᠢ ᠥᠭᠡᠷ᠎ᠡ ᠬᠣᠭᠣᠷᠣᠨᠳᠣ᠎ᠨ ᠠᠬᠠᠨ ᠳᠡᠭᠦᠦ ᠢᠨ ᠦᠵᠢᠯ ᠰᠠᠨᠠᠭᠠ ᠥᠠᠷ ᠬᠠᠷᠢᠴᠠᠬᠥ ᠤᠴᠢᠷ ᠲᠠᠢ᠃</fo:block>
</fo:block-container>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="1.5mm" start-indent="1.2em" text-indent="-1.2em" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#b08132">※ </fo:inline>Fonts used in the samples : Noto Sans SC, Noto Sans TC, Noto Sans KR, Noto Sans Hebrew, Noto Sans Arabic, Noto Sans Devanagari, Bengali, Tamil, Thai and Mongolian, Noto Serif Tibetan (this section), Noto Color Emoji and Roboto Flex (section 5.1). All of them are distributed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. The font files are not distributed with the source of this document; they are fetched from the Google Fonts server when the document is typeset.</fo:block>

      <!-- ──────────────── 6 Tables -->
      <fo:index-range-begin id="ixr-table" index-key="doc:table"/>
      <fo:block id="ch-table" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">Tables</fo:marker><!--tab:6--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="75.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">6</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="75.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">6</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">6</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">Tables</fo:block></fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-6-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">6.1 </fo:inline>fo:table, border-collapse, number-columns-spanned<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Value</fo:inline> : collapse | collapse-with-precedence | separate | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : collapse　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(border-collapse — XSL 1.1 §7.28.3)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Value</fo:inline> : &lt;number&gt;　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : 1　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : no　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(number-columns-spanned — XSL 1.1 §7.28.13)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:table flow object is used for formatting the tabular material of a table.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.7.3</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“collapse: The value "collapse" selects the collapsing borders model.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.28.3</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Both fixed (table-layout="fixed") and automatic column widths are supported, and proportional-column-width() divides the remaining width proportionally. The table header (fo:table-header) and footer (fo:table-footer) are repeated on every page when a table spans pages. Both the collapse and separate border models are supported; in collapse, the thicker border takes precedence per the spec's rules.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">An fo:retrieve-table-marker inside a cell of the table header (fo:table-header) or footer (fo:table-footer) is replaced by the content of an fo:marker (in a body cell, in a block inside a cell, or a child of fo:table-body) that falls in the fragment of that table on the page or column (XSL 1.1 §6.13.7). This is how a ledger writes "carried forward" and "subtotal", and how a table writes "(continued)". retrieve-position-within-table supports first-starting (the initial value), first-including-carryover, last-starting and last-ending; retrieve-boundary-within-table supports table (the initial value), table-fragment and page (§7.25.2, §7.25.6). The header and footer are laid out for each fragment, and when the retrieved content changes their height, the number of rows that fit in the fragment is decided accordingly. The form written as a child of fo:table (where the retrieved content is the fo:table-header or fo:table-footer itself) is not supported (it is reported in the import warnings).</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-6-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">border-collapse</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.28.3)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">collapse</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Selects the collapsing model, in which the borders of adjacent cells are merged.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">collapse-with-precedence</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The collapsing model, with conflicts between borders resolved by the border-*-precedence values.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: treated as collapse (border-*-precedence is not interpreted)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">separate</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Selects the separated model, in which each cell has its own borders.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">number-columns-spanned</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.28.13)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;number&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A positive integer: how many columns, starting from the current one, the fo:table-cell spans. Non-positive or non-integer values are rounded to an integer of 1 or more.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (rounded to the nearest integer of 1 or more; 2.6 becomes 3)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-6-1-->
<?kumiori-sample id="table" mark="border-collapse=&quot;collapse&quot;|number-columns-spanned=&quot;2&quot;|number-rows-spanned=&quot;2&quot;|proportional-column-width(1)|&lt;fo:table-header"?>
<fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse"
    border="1pt solid #1f3a5f" font-size="8.5pt">
  <fo:table-column column-width="28mm"/>
  <fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
  <fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
  <fo:table-header background-color="#1f3a5f" color="#ffffff"
      font-family="sans-serif">
    <fo:table-row>
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt"><fo:block>形式</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" number-columns-spanned="2">
        <fo:block text-align="center">特徴</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
    </fo:table-row>
  </fo:table-header>
  <fo:table-body>
    <fo:table-row>
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.5pt solid #9fb0cc">
        <fo:block>PNG</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.5pt solid #9fb0cc">
        <fo:block>可逆の圧縮</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.5pt solid #9fb0cc">
        <fo:block>透明度を持てる</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
    </fo:table-row>
    <fo:table-row background-color="#eef2f8">
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.5pt solid #9fb0cc"
          number-rows-spanned="2" display-align="center">
        <fo:block>SVG</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.5pt solid #9fb0cc">
        <fo:block>ベクター</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.5pt solid #9fb0cc">
        <fo:block>拡大しても粗くならない</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
    </fo:table-row>
    <fo:table-row background-color="#eef2f8">
      <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.5pt solid #9fb0cc"
          number-columns-spanned="2">
        <fo:block>グラデーション・切り抜き・模様・字を描ける</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
    </fo:table-row>
  </fo:table-body>
</fo:table>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-6-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">6.2 </fo:inline>fo:table-and-caption<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:table-and-caption flow object is used for formatting a table together with its caption.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.7.2</fo:block></fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-6-2--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">caption-side</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.28.7)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">before</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places the caption before the table (in the block-progression direction).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">after</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places the caption after the table (in the block-progression direction).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">start</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places the caption on the start side of the table in the inline direction (left in horizontal writing).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: placed before the table (block direction)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places the caption on the end side of the table in the inline direction (right in horizontal writing).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: placed after the table (block direction)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">top</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places the caption above the table.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: treated the same as before</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">bottom</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places the caption below the table.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">left</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places the caption to the left of the table.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">right</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places the caption to the right of the table.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-6-2-->
<?kumiori-sample id="table-caption" mark="&lt;fo:table-and-caption|caption-side=&quot;after&quot;|&lt;fo:table-caption&gt;"?>
<fo:table-and-caption caption-side="after" text-align="center">
  <fo:table-caption>
    <fo:block font-size="8pt" color="#4a443c"
        space-before="2pt">表 1　列の幅は比で分ける</fo:block>
  </fo:table-caption>
  <fo:table width="70%" margin-left="15%" border="0.6pt solid #1f3a5f">
    <fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
    <fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(2)"/>
    <fo:table-body>
      <fo:table-row>
        <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.4pt solid #9fb0cc">
          <fo:block>1</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
        <fo:table-cell padding="3pt" border="0.4pt solid #9fb0cc">
          <fo:block>2</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      </fo:table-row>
    </fo:table-body>
  </fo:table>
</fo:table-and-caption>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:index-range-end ref-id="ixr-table"/>
      <!-- ──────────────── 7 Lists -->
      <fo:block id="ch-list" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">Lists</fo:marker><!--tab:7--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="90.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">7</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="90.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">7</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">7</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">Lists</fo:block></fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-7-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">7.1 </fo:inline>fo:list-block, provisional-distance-between-starts<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Value</fo:inline> : &lt;length&gt; | &lt;percentage&gt; | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : 24.0pt　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(provisional-distance-between-starts — XSL 1.1 §7.30.12)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:list-block flow object is used to format a list.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.8.2</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:list-item formatting object contains the label and the body of an item in a list.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.8.3</fo:block></fo:block>
      <?kumiori-sample id="list" mark="provisional-distance-between-starts=&quot;9mm&quot;|provisional-distance-between-starts=&quot;5mm&quot;|provisional-label-separation=&quot;2mm&quot;|label-end()|body-start()"?>
<fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="9mm"
    provisional-label-separation="2mm">
  <fo:list-item>
    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
      <fo:block text-align="end" color="#b5562b">(1)</fo:block></fo:list-item-label>
    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
      <fo:block>一つ目の項目。本文が長くなって行を折り返すと、二行目以降もラベルの幅の分だけ下がった本文の左端にそろいます。</fo:block></fo:list-item-body>
  </fo:list-item>
  <fo:list-item space-before="2pt">
    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
      <fo:block text-align="end" color="#b5562b">(2)</fo:block></fo:list-item-label>
    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
      <fo:block>二つ目の項目には、入れ子のリストがあります。</fo:block>
      <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="5mm">
        <fo:list-item>
          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
            <fo:block>・</fo:block></fo:list-item-label>
          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
            <fo:block>入れ子の項目</fo:block></fo:list-item-body>
        </fo:list-item>
      </fo:list-block>
    </fo:list-item-body>
  </fo:list-item>
</fo:list-block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">The positions of the item label (fo:list-item-label) and the item body (fo:list-item-body) are determined by the label-end() and body-start() functions. Nested lists are also supported.</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-7-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">provisional-distance-between-starts</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.30.12)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies, as a length, the provisional distance from the start of the label to the start of the body. It is used to compute body-start().</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies that distance as a percentage of the width of the closest ancestor block-area.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-7-1-->

      <!-- ──────────────── 8 Footnotes and floats -->
      <fo:index-range-begin id="ixr-out" index-key="doc:out"/>
      <fo:block id="ch-out" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">Footnotes and floats</fo:marker><!--tab:8--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="105.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">8</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="105.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">8</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">8</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">Footnotes and floats</fo:block></fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-8-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">8.1 </fo:inline>fo:footnote<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:footnote is typically used to produce footnote-citations within the region-body of a page and the corresponding footnote in a separate area nearer the after-edge of the page.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.12.3</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">The footnote body is placed at the bottom of the page that holds the citation. The separator between the body text and the footnotes is drawn with the contents of the fo:static-content whose flow-name is "xsl-footnote-separator". This document places a thin 30mm fo:leader rule there (see the bottom of this page).</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-8-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">flow-name</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.5)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;name&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The name of a flow (fo:flow or fo:static-content). Its contents are poured into the region with the same name.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">xsl-footnote-separator</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A reserved name: the contents of this fo:static-content are placed as the separator at the beginning of the footnote area.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">xsl-before-float-separator</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A reserved name: the contents of this fo:static-content are placed as the separator at the end of the area for floats placed at the top of the page (before-floats).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-8-1-->
<?kumiori-sample id="footnote" mark="&lt;fo:footnote&gt;|&lt;fo:footnote-body&gt;"?>
<fo:block>この文には脚注があります<fo:footnote>
    <fo:inline baseline-shift="super" font-size="70%" color="#b5562b">*1</fo:inline>
    <fo:footnote-body>
      <fo:block font-size="7.5pt"
          color="#4a443c">*1　これはページの下に置かれる脚注の本文です。</fo:block>
    </fo:footnote-body>
  </fo:footnote>。脚注の本文は、このページの下にあります。</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-8-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">8.2 </fo:inline>fo:float<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:float formatting object is typically used either to cause an image to be positioned in a separate area at the beginning of a page, or to cause an image to be positioned to one side, with normal content flowing around and along-side the image.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.12.2</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">float="start" and float="end" make the body text flow around a box pushed to one side. float="before" places the box at the top of the page.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">The values start, end and both of clear (XSL 1.1 §7.19.1) on fo:block start the block below (in vertical writing, to the left of) the earlier fo:float on that side. left is read as start and right as end. inside and outside, and clear on elements other than fo:block (fo:float, fo:table, fo:block-container, fo:list-block and so on), are not supported (a warning at load time reports them).</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-8-2--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">float</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.19.2)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">before</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places the contents of the fo:float in the float area at the top of the page in the region-body (before-float).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">start</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Floats the contents to the start side of the reference area.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Floats the contents to the end side of the reference area.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">left</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Treated as float="start".</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">right</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Treated as float="end".</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">inside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Floats the contents to the binding side of the page (the start side when there is no binding side).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: decided by taking the binding side to be the start side on odd pages and the end side on even pages</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">outside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Floats the contents to the side opposite the binding (the fore-edge side; the end side when there is no binding side).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: decided by taking the binding side to be the start side on odd pages and the end side on even pages</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Does not float; the contents are placed in their normal position.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">clear</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.19.1)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">start</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Moves this area down past any preceding start-side floats (left, start).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Moves this area down past any preceding end-side floats (right, end).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">left</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Treated as clear="start".</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">right</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Treated as clear="end".</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">inside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Moves this area down past any preceding inside floats.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">outside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Moves this area down past any preceding outside floats.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">both</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Moves this area down past all preceding side floats.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Imposes no positional constraint with respect to floats.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-8-2-->
<?kumiori-sample id="float" mark="float=&quot;end&quot;"?>
<fo:block>
  <fo:float float="end">
    <fo:block-container width="32mm" margin-left="3mm" margin-right="0mm"
        padding="3pt" background-color="#eef2f8" border="0.6pt solid #9fb0cc">
      <fo:block start-indent="0mm" end-indent="0mm" font-size="8pt"
          text-align="center">
        <fo:external-graphic src="images/woven.png" content-width="30mm"/>
        <fo:block>右に寄せたフロート</fo:block>
      </fo:block>
    </fo:block-container>
  </fo:float>
  右に寄せた箱の周りに、本文が回り込みます。箱の高さを過ぎると、本文は元の幅に戻ります。組み織りの名は、組版の「組み」と、布を「織る」ことに由来します。縦の糸と横の糸を組み合わせるように、字と行と段とページを組み合わせて紙面を作ります。回り込みの見本のために、もう少し文を続けます。行の幅は箱の手前で縮み、箱の下では元に戻ります。この段落の終わりの行は、箱の下の広い幅で組まれています。
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:index-range-end ref-id="ixr-out"/>
      <!-- ──────────────── 9 Images -->
      <fo:index-range-begin id="ixr-image" index-key="doc:image"/>
      <fo:block id="ch-image" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">Images</fo:marker><!--tab:9--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="120.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">9</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="120.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">9</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">9</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">Images</fo:block></fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-9-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">9.1 </fo:inline>fo:external-graphic<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:external-graphic flow object is used for a graphic where the graphics data resides outside of the fo:element tree.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.6.5</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Kumiori interprets images in 11 formats (see the table after the sample; for WebP, two samples are shown, lossy and lossless). The samples below are all the same picture (an evening sky, stars, a setting sun, a mountain range and a woven band) written out in each format. The picture is our own, drawn by scripts/make-conformance-images.py in the Kumiori repository; for the vector formats (SVG, EPS, WMF, EMF, CGM) that script assembles the file contents directly.</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-9-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">src</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.30.16)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;uri-specification&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies, as a URI, the location of the external resource (such as an image) to be taken in as the content.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-9-1-->
<?kumiori-sample id="images" mark="&lt;fo:external-graphic"?>
<fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" font-size="7.5pt"
    text-align="center">
  <fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"
      number-columns-repeated="4"/>
  <fo:table-body>
    <fo:table-row>
      <fo:table-cell padding="2pt"><fo:block><fo:external-graphic
          src="images/woven.png" content-width="33mm"/></fo:block>
        <fo:block>PNG (透明の角)</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="2pt"><fo:block><fo:external-graphic
          src="images/woven.jpg" content-width="33mm"/></fo:block>
        <fo:block>JPEG</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="2pt"><fo:block><fo:external-graphic
          src="images/woven.gif" content-width="33mm"/></fo:block>
        <fo:block>GIF (64 色)</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="2pt"><fo:block><fo:external-graphic
          src="images/woven.bmp" content-width="33mm"/></fo:block>
        <fo:block>BMP (8 ビット)</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
    </fo:table-row>
    <fo:table-row>
      <fo:table-cell padding="2pt"><fo:block><fo:external-graphic
          src="images/woven.tif" content-width="33mm"/></fo:block>
        <fo:block>TIFF (LZW)</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="2pt"><fo:block><fo:external-graphic
          src="images/woven.webp" content-width="33mm"/></fo:block>
        <fo:block>WebP (非可逆)</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="2pt"><fo:block><fo:external-graphic
          src="images/woven-lossless.webp" content-width="33mm"/></fo:block>
        <fo:block>WebP (可逆)</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="2pt"><fo:block><fo:external-graphic
          src="images/woven.svg" content-width="33mm"/></fo:block>
        <fo:block>SVG</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
    </fo:table-row>
    <fo:table-row>
      <fo:table-cell padding="2pt"><fo:block><fo:external-graphic
          src="images/woven.eps" content-width="33mm"/></fo:block>
        <fo:block>EPS</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="2pt"><fo:block><fo:external-graphic
          src="images/woven.wmf" content-width="33mm"/></fo:block>
        <fo:block>WMF</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="2pt"><fo:block><fo:external-graphic
          src="images/woven.emf" content-width="33mm"/></fo:block>
        <fo:block>EMF</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell padding="2pt"><fo:block><fo:external-graphic
          src="images/woven.cgm" content-width="33mm"/></fo:block>
        <fo:block>CGM</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
    </fo:table-row>
  </fo:table-body>
</fo:table>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>
      <fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="8pt" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">
        <fo:table-column column-width="22mm"/>
        <fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
        <fo:table-header font-family="sans-serif" color="#ffffff" background-color="#1f3a5f">
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt"><fo:block>Format</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt"><fo:block>What Kumiori supports</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
        </fo:table-header>
        <fo:table-body>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif">PNG</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Grayscale, RGB and palette color types; transparency (alpha, tRNS); resolution (pHYs).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif">JPEG</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Embedded in the PDF as the original byte stream. Resolution (JFIF).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif">GIF</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Palette images and the transparent color.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif">BMP</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>1, 4, 8, 16, 24 and 32 bits (uncompressed and bit fields); resolution.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif">TIFF</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Compression schemes including uncompressed, LZW, Deflate, PackBits and CCITT (fax); resolution.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif">WebP</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Lossy (VP8) and lossless (VP8L); transparency.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif">SVG</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>SVG 1.1 shapes, paths, gradients, patterns, clipping, masks and text. Drawn into the PDF as vectors.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif">EPS</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>The PostScript language is interpreted inside Kumiori and drawn (shapes, images, text in embedded fonts).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif">WMF, EMF</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Windows metafiles. Shapes, pens, brushes, text, images, clipping, world transforms and gradients (EMF).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif">CGM</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>ISO/IEC 8632 binary-encoded graphics (lines, polygons, circles and ellipses and their arcs, curves, text, fills and patterns, cell-array images; except GDP and POLYSYMBOL).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
        </fo:table-body>
      </fo:table>

      <fo:block id="s-9-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">9.2 </fo:inline>content-width, content-height, scaling<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Value</fo:inline> : auto | scale-to-fit | scale-down-to-fit | scale-up-to-fit | &lt;length&gt; | &lt;percentage&gt; | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : auto　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : no　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(content-width — XSL 1.1 §7.15.5)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Value</fo:inline> : auto | scale-to-fit | scale-down-to-fit | scale-up-to-fit | &lt;length&gt; | &lt;percentage&gt; | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : auto　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : no　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(content-height — XSL 1.1 §7.15.4)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Value</fo:inline> : uniform | non-uniform | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : uniform　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : no　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(scaling — XSL 1.1 §7.15.12)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“auto: The content-width should be the intrinsic content-width.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.15.5</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">The intrinsic size of an image is determined from its resolution for raster images (this sample is 144 dpi and 240 pixels wide = 42.3mm) and from the size recorded in the file for vector images. scale-to-fit, scale-down-to-fit and scale-up-to-fit are supported, as is scaling="non-uniform" (changing the aspect ratio).</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-9-2--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">content-width</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.15.5)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Uses the intrinsic width of the image.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">scale-to-fit</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Scales the image by the largest factor at which its width does not exceed the width of the viewport.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">scale-down-to-fit</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Leaves the image as is when its intrinsic width does not exceed the viewport width; otherwise shrinks it until it fits.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">scale-up-to-fit</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Leaves the image as is when its intrinsic width is at least the viewport width; otherwise enlarges it until it fills the viewport.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Sets the width of the content to the specified length.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the width as a percentage of the intrinsic width of the image.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">content-height</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.15.4)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Uses the intrinsic height of the image.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">scale-to-fit</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Scales the image by the largest factor at which its height does not exceed the height of the viewport.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">scale-down-to-fit</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Leaves the image as is when its intrinsic height does not exceed the viewport height; otherwise shrinks it until it fits.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">scale-up-to-fit</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Leaves the image as is when its intrinsic height is at least the viewport height; otherwise enlarges it until it fills the viewport.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Sets the height of the content to the specified length.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the height as a percentage of the intrinsic height of the image.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">scaling</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.15.12)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">uniform</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Scaling preserves the aspect ratio.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">non-uniform</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Scaling need not preserve the aspect ratio.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-9-2-->
<?kumiori-sample id="image-size" mark="content-width=&quot;40mm&quot;|content-height=&quot;12mm&quot;|scaling=&quot;non-uniform&quot;|content-height=&quot;1em&quot;"?>
<fo:block>
  本来の大きさ: <fo:external-graphic src="images/woven.png"/>
</fo:block>
<fo:block space-before="3pt">
  縦横の比を変える:
  <fo:external-graphic src="images/woven.svg" content-width="40mm"
      content-height="12mm" scaling="non-uniform"/>
  行の中の小さな画像 <fo:external-graphic src="images/woven.svg" content-height="1em"/> も置けます。
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-9-3" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">9.3 </fo:inline>fo:instream-foreign-object (SVG)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“The fo:instream-foreign-object flow object is used for an inline graphic or other "generic" object where the object data resides as descendants of the fo:instream-foreign-object, typically as an XML element subtree in a non-XSL namespace.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §6.6.6</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">SVG and MathML (see the next chapter) can be placed inside it.</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-9-3--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">content-type</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.30.7)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Does not specify the type of the content; the formatter may inspect the content to decide.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;string&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the type of the content either as a MIME type following "content-type:" or as a namespace prefix following "namespace-prefix:".</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: used only to recognize MathML in fo:external-graphic</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-9-3-->
<?kumiori-sample id="instream-svg" mark="&lt;fo:instream-foreign-object&gt;"?>
<fo:block text-align="center">
  <fo:instream-foreign-object>
    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="60mm" height="24mm"
        viewBox="0 0 120 48">
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#1f3a93"/>
          <stop offset="1" stop-color="#d9472b"/>
        </linearGradient>
      </defs>
      <rect x="1" y="1" width="118" height="46" rx="8" fill="url(#g)"/>
      <text x="60" y="31" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="16" fill="#fff"
          text-anchor="middle">組み織り</text>
    </svg>
  </fo:instream-foreign-object>
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:index-range-end ref-id="ixr-image"/>
      <!-- ──────────────── 10 Mathematics -->
      <fo:block id="ch-math" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">Mathematics (MathML)</fo:marker><!--tab:10--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="135.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">10</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="135.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">10</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">10</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">Mathematics (MathML)</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“MathML is a markup language for describing mathematical notation and capturing both its structure and content.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— MathML Core, Abstract</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">MathML placed inside fo:instream-foreign-object is typeset with a math font that has an OpenType MATH table (STIX Two Math). Fractions, radicals, superscripts and subscripts, under- and over-scripts, stretchy brackets and matrices (mtable) are supported. The MathML Core elements are interpreted, as are MathML 3 elements such as mfenced. Examples of MathML inside HTML are in the HTML and CSS edition.</fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-10-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">10.1 </fo:inline>mfrac, msqrt, msup (the quadratic formula)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="math-quadratic" mark="&lt;mfrac&gt;|&lt;msqrt&gt;|&lt;msup&gt;"?>
<fo:block text-align="center">
  <fo:instream-foreign-object>
    <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block">
      <mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo>
      <mfrac>
        <mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>±</mo>
          <msqrt><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo>
            <mn>4</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi></msqrt>
        </mrow>
        <mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow>
      </mfrac>
    </math>
  </fo:instream-foreign-object>
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-10-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">10.2 </fo:inline>munderover, mtable (summation and a matrix)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="math-sum-matrix" mark="&lt;munderover&gt;|&lt;mtable&gt;"?>
<fo:block text-align="center">
  <fo:instream-foreign-object>
    <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block">
      <munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow>
        <mi>n</mi></munderover>
      <mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo>
      <mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow>
        <mn>2</mn></mfrac>
      <mspace width="2em"/>
      <mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo>
      <mrow><mo>(</mo>
        <mtable>
          <mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr>
          <mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd></mtr>
        </mtable>
      <mo>)</mo></mrow>
    </math>
  </fo:instream-foreign-object>
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <fo:block id="s-10-3" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">10.3 </fo:inline>Inline math<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="math-inline" mark="&lt;fo:instream-foreign-object&gt;"?>
<fo:block>
  円の面積は <fo:instream-foreign-object><math
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi>
    <msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></fo:instream-foreign-object>
  で、積分で書くと <fo:instream-foreign-object><math
      xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
    <msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>r</mi></msubsup><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mi>t</mi>
    <mspace width="0.2em"/><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></fo:instream-foreign-object>
  です。数式は本文の行の中に収まります。
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <!-- ──────────────── 11 Page breaks and fragmentation control -->
      <fo:block id="ch-break" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">Page breaks and fragmentation control</fo:marker><!--tab:11--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="150.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">11</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="150.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">11</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">11</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">Page breaks and fragmentation control</fo:block></fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-11-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">11.1 </fo:inline>break-before, keep-together, widows<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Value</fo:inline> : auto | column | page | even-page | odd-page | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : auto　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : no　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(break-before — XSL 1.1 §7.20.2)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Value</fo:inline> : &lt;keep&gt; | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : .within-line=auto, .within-column=auto, .within-page=auto　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(keep-together — XSL 1.1 §7.20.3)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Value</fo:inline> : &lt;integer&gt; | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : 2　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : yes　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(widows — XSL 1.1 §7.20.7)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“page: Imposes a break-before condition with a context consisting of page-areas.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.20.2</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">“This property imposes keep-together conditions on formatting objects.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.20.3</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">In this document, chapter headings carry break-before="page" so that each chapter starts on a new page, and headings carry keep-with-next so that a heading is never left alone at the end of a page. A box with keep-together="always" is moved to the next page when it does not fit in what remains of the current one. widows and orphans (initial value 2) keep a paragraph from leaving a single line at the beginning or end of a page. An integer keep strength of 1 or more is treated the same as always (strengths are not compared with one another; in AH Formatter compatibility mode (<fo:inline font-family="monospace" keep-together.within-line="always">--compat antenna</fo:inline>, Appendix B) the integer is not used for keep-together on blocks).</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">page-break-before, page-break-after and page-break-inside (XSL 1.1 §7.31.16–§7.31.18) are mapped as in the tables of the specification. For page-break-before and page-break-after, always becomes page on break-before and break-after, left becomes even-page, right becomes odd-page, and avoid becomes always on keep-with-previous and keep-with-next. avoid on page-break-inside becomes always on keep-together. When an individual property such as break-before is also written, the individual property is used (§5.2).</fo:block>
<!--gen:vals-s-11-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">break-before</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.20.2)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Forces no page or column break.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">column</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places the first area of this element at the start of a column (column break).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places the first area of this element at the start of a page (page break).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">even-page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places the first area of this element at the start of an even page, inserting a blank page if needed.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">odd-page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places the first area of this element at the start of an odd page, inserting a blank page if needed.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">keep-together</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.20.3)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Imposes no keep-together condition.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">always</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Imposes, with the strongest strength, “always”, the condition that the content is not split within a line (.within-line), a column (.within-column) or a page (.within-page).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: .within-page and .within-column are not distinguished and are treated alike</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;integer&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Imposes a keep-together condition with that integer as its strength.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (1 or more is treated the same as always; not used for blocks in compatibility mode)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">widows</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.20.7)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;integer&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The minimum number of lines to place in the last area of a paragraph (the part carried over to the next page or column).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-11-1-->
<?kumiori-sample id="keep" mark="keep-together.within-page=&quot;always&quot;"?>
<fo:block keep-together.within-page="always" border="0.6pt solid #9fb0cc"
    padding="4pt">
  <fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">分けない囲み</fo:block>
  <fo:block>この囲みは keep-together.within-page="always" なので、ページをまたぎません。</fo:block>
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

      <!-- ──────────────── 13 Unsupported elements (placed after the multi-column layout of chapter 12: chapter 12 is in the next page-sequence because it changes the page type) -->
    </fo:flow>
  </fo:page-sequence>

  <!-- ================================================================ 12 Multi-column layout (page master with 2 columns) -->
  <fo:page-sequence master-reference="book-2col">
    <fo:static-content flow-name="foot-odd"><fo:block text-align="end" end-indent="7mm" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7pt" color="#6b7275"><fo:retrieve-marker retrieve-class-name="chapter" retrieve-position="first-including-carryover"/>　|　<fo:page-number/></fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:static-content flow-name="foot-even"><fo:block text-align="start" start-indent="7mm" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7pt" color="#6b7275"><fo:page-number/>　|　Kumiori Conformance Guide — XSL-FO 1.1</fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:static-content flow-name="tab-odd"><fo:block><fo:retrieve-marker retrieve-class-name="tab-odd" retrieve-position="first-including-carryover"/></fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:static-content flow-name="tab-even"><fo:block><fo:retrieve-marker retrieve-class-name="tab-even" retrieve-position="first-including-carryover"/></fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:static-content flow-name="xsl-footnote-separator"><fo:block line-height="1" padding-after="2pt"><fo:leader leader-pattern="rule" leader-length="30mm" rule-thickness="0.5pt" color="#6b7275"/></fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body" text-align="justify">
      <fo:block id="ch-columns" span="all" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">Multi-column layout</fo:marker><!--tab:12--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="165.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">12</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="165.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">12</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">12</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">Multi-column layout</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block id="s-12-1" span="all" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">12.1 </fo:inline>column-count and span<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" span="all" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Value</fo:inline> : &lt;number&gt; | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : 1　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : no　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(column-count — XSL 1.1 §7.27.2)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block role="props" span="all" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" line-height="1.6" color="#3b4245" space-after="1mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start"><fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Value</fo:inline> : none | all | inherit　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Initial value</fo:inline> : none　<fo:inline color="#4f7a64">● Inherited</fo:inline> : no　<fo:inline color="#8c9396">(span — XSL 1.1 §7.21.4)</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block span="all" font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#f4f6f5" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="4mm" space-after.conditionality="retain" text-align="start">“all: The areas resulting from this flow object shall span all the columns of a multi-column region.”<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="6.5pt" color="#6b7275" text-align="end">— XSL 1.1 §7.21.4 "span"</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">The pages of this chapter are typeset with a page master whose region-body has column-count="2" and column-gap="7mm". The body text flows from the left column to the right column, and at the end of the page continues into the left column of the next page. The chapter heading and the quotation have span="all" and are placed across both columns.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">In a multi-column region-body, Kumiori by default fills the columns in order, starting from the left. To make the columns the same height (to balance them), add column-fill="balance" (axf:column-fill="balance" is the same) to the region-body. Only two things balance columns by default: multi-column layout in HTML and CSS (column-count), and blocks with axf:column-count, described next. There the content is split so that the first columns are longer and the later columns shorter.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">XSL 1.1 has no multi-column layout on fo:block-container, but the axf: extensions let you write column-count and column-gap on fo:block-container too, making the inside of the block multi-column. Kumiori interprets both the axf:-prefixed names (axf:column-count and so on) and the unprefixed names (Appendix A).</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">As a sample of multi-column layout, a somewhat longer text follows. Typesetting is the work of deciding the size of the characters, the length of the lines, the space between lines and between columns, and arranging the characters on the page. When lines are too long, the reader's eye easily loses its way when returning from the end of one line to the start of the next. Multi-column layout lets you use a wide page while keeping each line at a readable length. This is why newspapers and magazines use columns.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">If the gap between columns (column-gap) is too narrow, the lines seem to merge with those of the neighbouring column. If it is too wide, the page loses its unity. This document uses 7mm.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">In Japanese typesetting, the column width is often made an integer multiple of the character size. The positions of the characters at the ends of the lines then line up, and justification has to widen the spaces between characters less. The column width of this document is not an integer multiple of the character size, so the spacing between characters is adjusted on every line.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">Tables, images and formulas can be placed inside columns too. Anything wider than a column is either shrunk so that it does not overflow the column, or placed across the columns with span="all". Footnotes go at the bottom of the page even on multi-column pages.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">Add keep-with-next so that a heading is not left alone at the end of a column. The space before a paragraph that comes at the top of a column (space-before) is discarded by the rule in the specification (§4.3). This keeps the tops of the columns aligned. A change of span="all" is also an area boundary, so only the spaces with conditionality="retain" remain before and after it (§4.3.1).</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">To finish the multi-column sample, a little more text follows. The name Kumiori comes from the "kumi" of kumihan (typesetting) and "ori", weaving cloth. Just as warp and weft are combined, characters, lines, columns and pages are combined to make the page.</fo:block>
      <fo:block span="all" space-before="3mm" space-before.conditionality="retain">
      <!--gen:vals-s-12-1--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">column-count</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.2)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;number&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The number of columns in the region. A positive integer; 1 means no multi-column layout. Values that are not positive or not integers are rounded to an integer of 1 or more.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (rounded to the nearest integer of 1 or more; 2.6 becomes 3)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">column-gap</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.27.3)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The width of the gap between adjacent columns. Negative values become 0pt.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the gap between columns as a percentage of the content width of the region.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">span</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(XSL 1.1 §7.21.4)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Does not span columns; placed in the current column.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">all</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Placed across all the columns of a multi-column region.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:vals-s-12-1-->
      </fo:block>
    </fo:flow>
  </fo:page-sequence>

  <!-- ================================================================ 13 and the appendices -->
  <fo:page-sequence master-reference="book">
    <fo:static-content flow-name="foot-odd"><fo:block text-align="end" end-indent="7mm" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7pt" color="#6b7275"><fo:retrieve-marker retrieve-class-name="chapter" retrieve-position="first-including-carryover"/>　|　<fo:page-number/></fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:static-content flow-name="foot-even"><fo:block text-align="start" start-indent="7mm" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7pt" color="#6b7275"><fo:page-number/>　|　Kumiori Conformance Guide — XSL-FO 1.1</fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:static-content flow-name="tab-odd"><fo:block><fo:retrieve-marker retrieve-class-name="tab-odd" retrieve-position="first-including-carryover"/></fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:static-content flow-name="tab-even"><fo:block><fo:retrieve-marker retrieve-class-name="tab-even" retrieve-position="first-including-carryover"/></fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:static-content flow-name="xsl-footnote-separator"><fo:block line-height="1" padding-after="2pt"><fo:leader leader-pattern="rule" leader-length="30mm" rule-thickness="0.5pt" color="#6b7275"/></fo:block></fo:static-content>
    <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body" text-align="justify">
<fo:block id="ch-missing" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">Unsupported elements and properties</fo:marker><!--tab:13--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="180.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">13</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="180.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">13</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">13</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">Unsupported elements and properties</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Using the method of Chapter 1, this chapter lists, section by section of the specification, the elements and properties for which nothing reached the typesetting even when they were specified. Unsupported elements inside blocks and lines are ignored, and any text inside them is typeset as far as possible. Unsupported elements inside fo:page-sequence, fo:layout-master-set and fo:declarations (fo:title, the second and later fo:flow, fo:flow-map, fo:color-profile and so on) are discarded without typesetting their contents. In both cases, a warning at load time reports the names and the number of the ignored elements. The aural and interactive (dynamic effect) properties are gathered in the last table. Unsupported values of supported elements and properties are described in the individual sections. Each entry says what the item is and in what situations it is used. The descriptions are based on the definitions in the retrieved specifications (all retrieved 2026-11-06) and on what was verified in the Kumiori source.</fo:block>
      <!--gen:unsupported--><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="8.8pt" color="#23313a" space-before="4mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always">Unsupported elements (14 items)</fo:block>
<fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"><fo:table-column column-width="36mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Name</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Description</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:multi-switch</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.9.3</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Shows only one of the several fo:multi-case elements placed inside it, and switches the one shown by means of fo:multi-toggle. Kumiori does not support the switching (fo:multi-toggle is ignored) and typesets only the content of the first fo:multi-case whose starting-state is show (no switching in PDF). A note in the specification gives interactive uses such as displaying a table of contents (XSL 1.1 §6.9.3).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:multi-case</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.9.4</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Holds one of the alternatives shown by switching inside fo:multi-switch. Used in documents viewed on screen to write each of the pieces of content that the display switches between.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:multi-toggle</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.9.5</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Creates a range which, when activated (“clicked” in the specification's example), switches the fo:multi-case that is shown. The target is given by switch-to (XSL 1.1 §6.9.5). Used in documents viewed on screen to make a button (a place to click) that switches the display.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:multi-properties</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.9.6</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Applies one of several sets of properties, switched between, to the same content. Its children are a sequence of fo:multi-property-set followed by one fo:wrapper. A note in the specification gives the example of changing the appearance of a link when it changes from not yet visited to visited (XSL 1.1 §6.9.6).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:multi-property-set</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.9.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Holds one of the sets of properties switched between inside fo:multi-properties. The state in which it applies is given by active-state. Used in documents viewed on screen to change the appearance according to the state of a link and the like.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:scaling-value-citation</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.6.15</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Outputs, as integer percentage characters, the scale factor applied to the fo:external-graphic pointed to by ref-id. A note in the specification says this can show the scale of a figure that is normally shown at actual size but is reduced only when it does not fit (XSL 1.1 §6.6.15).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:flow-map</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.4.22</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the assignment of which flows (fo:flow and so on) are poured into which regions. It is used from fo:page-sequence by naming it in flow-map-reference. Used to treat several flows in sequence as one flow, or to pour one flow through several regions of a page in sequence.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:flow-assignment</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.4.23</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies, inside fo:flow-map, one pair assigning a sequence of flows (fo:flow-source-list) to a sequence of regions (fo:flow-target-list). Used when assigning flows to regions in fo:flow-map.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:flow-source-list</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.4.24</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the sequence of flows to be assigned, as a sequence of fo:flow-name-specifier. The flows must be either all fo:flow or all fo:static-content. Used in fo:flow-map to list the flows that are treated as one flow.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:flow-target-list</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.4.26</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the sequence of target regions, as a sequence of fo:region-name-specifier. Used in fo:flow-map to list the regions into which the flows are poured.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:flow-name-specifier</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.4.25</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>References one flow in the sequence of flows, by flow-name-reference. Used to list flows in fo:flow-source-list.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:region-name-specifier</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.4.27</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>References one region in the sequence of regions, by region-name-reference. Used to list regions in fo:flow-target-list.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:color-profile</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.4.4</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Declares an ICC colour profile by name (color-profile-name) and URI (src). A declared profile is referenced by name from the rgb-icc function. Used to specify colours as values in a particular ICC profile.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">fo:title</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §6.4.21</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Gives a title to a page-sequence. The specification says an interactive processor can show it in a title window (“title” window) or a tooltip (XSL 1.1 §6.4.21). Used to tell page sequences apart by title when viewing on screen.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="8.8pt" color="#23313a" space-before="4mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always">Unsupported properties (34 items)</fo:block>
<fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"><fo:table-column column-width="36mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Name</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Description</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">role</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.5</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Indicates the role of the XML element from which the formatting object came, as a string or an RDF URI. The specification calls it “a hint for alternate renderers (aural readers, etc.)” (XSL 1.1 §7.5.2). It serves as a hint for processors that present the document in a way other than ordinary display, such as reading it aloud.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">source-document</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.5</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Points, by URI, to the XML document from which the formatting object came. The specification says the value “has no inherent standardized semantics for any XSL processor” (XSL 1.1 §7.5.1). It also says that accessibility guidelines strongly recommend putting this on fo:root and the like.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">background-attachment</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.8</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies whether the background image is fixed to the viewport (fixed) or moves with the document (scroll). Used to keep the background image still when scrolling a document on screen.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">font-selection-strategy</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.9</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies how the characters being typeset (the characters in context) are used, in addition to the font properties, when choosing a font. The values are auto and character-by-character. The specification gives the example of choosing between a font that holds Latin, Greek and Cyrillic together and better-quality fonts that hold each separately (XSL 1.1 §7.9.3).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">font-size-adjust</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.9</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the ratio of the x-height to the font size (the aspect value). It preserves the apparent size and legibility of the characters when a substitute font is used. The specification says that substituting a font on the basis of the font size alone can produce illegible text (XSL 1.1 §7.9.6). Used when the specified font is not available and so on.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">alignment-adjust</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.14</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Fixes the position of the point aligned by the alignment baseline (alignment-baseline). It is used especially to fine-tune the alignment of things such as figures that have no baseline table. Used to fine-tune the position of a figure placed in a line relative to the baseline of the text.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">dominant-baseline</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.14</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Redetermines the baseline table (scaled-baseline-table) used as the reference for alignment. Used to specify the baseline table explicitly when the initial value auto does not give the desired result (XSL 1.1 §7.14.5).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">allowed-height-scale</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.15</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the list of scale factors that may be used when scaling a graphic in the height direction. any means no constraint. Used to restrict the scale factors used for scaling a graphic to fixed values.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">allowed-width-scale</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.15</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the list of scale factors that may be used when scaling a graphic in the width direction. any means no constraint. Used to restrict the scale factors used for scaling a graphic to fixed values.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">scaling-method</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.15</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the preferred method (auto, integer-pixels or resample-any-method) for scaling a bitmap graphic. Used to choose whether to enlarge a bitmap graphic by an integer number of pixels or to resample it to the required size.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">hyphenation-keep</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.16</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Requires the two parts of a hyphenated word to be placed in the same column (column) or on the same page (page). It decides whether hyphenation may occur on the last line that fits in the reference area. Used to avoid a word being split across columns or pages. Kumiori breaks lines before it distributes them over pages and does not break them again afterwards, so column and page are not interpreted (the text is typeset as with auto).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">suppress-at-line-break</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.17</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies whether the character of an fo:character is removed (suppress) or kept (retain) when it comes next to a line break. With auto only U+0020 is removed. Used to keep characters that fall at the start or end of a line from being shown.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">text-shadow</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.17</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Adds shadows to the characters. For each shadow, the offset (two lengths), the blur radius and the colour are specified. Used to typeset text with shadows.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">treat-as-word-space</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.17</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies whether the character of an fo:character is treated as a word space (word space) or as an ordinary character. If true it receives the word-spacing adjustment. Used to extend word-spacing adjustment to characters other than the space, or to exclude characters from it.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">color-profile-name</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.18</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The name given to the colour profile declared by fo:color-profile. Used to reference the declared profile by name from the rgb-icc function.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">rendering-intent</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.18</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies, for a colour profile, the method (perceptual, relative-colorimetric, saturation or absolute-colorimetric) for mapping colours into the gamut of the output device. It applies mainly to CMYK profiles. Used to choose how colours are mapped, for example preserving the relationships between colours in photographs or matching the colour values.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">intrusion-displace</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.19</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies how lines or blocks are displaced (auto, none, line, indent or block) when a float intrudes. Used to choose, around a side float, whether only the lines are shortened or the block is displaced together with its indents.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">clip</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.21</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>For elements whose overflow is other than visible, specifies the visible region (the clip) as rect(top, right, bottom, left). XSL adds the values error-if-overflow and repeat. Used to narrow the visible part of overflowing content.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">flow-map-name</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.27</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The name given to an fo:flow-map. It is referenced from the flow-map-reference of fo:page-sequence. Used to define an fo:flow-map and reference it from fo:page-sequence.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">flow-map-reference</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.27</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Names the fo:flow-map used by an fo:page-sequence. When none is named, the implicit assignment defined by the specification is used. Used to pour the flows of a page sequence into regions by the assignment of an fo:flow-map.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">flow-name-reference</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.27</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>In fo:flow-name-specifier, names by flow-name the flow to put in the sequence. Used to list flows in fo:flow-source-list.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">media-usage</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.27</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies how the output medium is used. paginate produces page sequences; bounded-in-one-dimension produces just one page per fo:page-sequence and lets the content determine the size in one direction. Used, for example, to typeset the content on a single sheet whose length matches the content, instead of dividing it into pages.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">region-name-reference</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.27.21</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>In fo:region-name-specifier, names by region-name the region into which the flow is poured. It may not be empty and must name a region-name that exists in the document. Used to list regions in fo:flow-target-list in fo:flow-map.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">border-after-precedence</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.28.1</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>When table borders are collapsed (border-collapse="collapse-with-precedence"), specifies the precedence of this element's after-side border. The value is force or an integer; the larger wins. force takes precedence over any integer. The initial value differs by element: fo:table 6, fo:table-cell 5, fo:table-column 4, fo:table-row 3, fo:table-body 2, fo:table-header 1, fo:table-footer 0. Used in tables to decide, by a ranking per element, which of the borders of adjacent cells and of the table frame is drawn.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">border-before-precedence</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.28.2</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>When table borders are collapsed (border-collapse="collapse-with-precedence"), specifies the precedence of this element's before-side border. The value is force or an integer; the larger wins. force takes precedence over any integer. The initial value differs by element: fo:table 6, fo:table-cell 5, fo:table-column 4, fo:table-row 3, fo:table-body 2, fo:table-header 1, fo:table-footer 0. Used in tables to decide, by a ranking per element, which of the borders of adjacent cells and of the table frame is drawn.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">border-end-precedence</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.28.4</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>When table borders are collapsed (border-collapse="collapse-with-precedence"), specifies the precedence of this element's end-side border. The value is force or an integer; the larger wins. force takes precedence over any integer. The initial value differs by element: fo:table 6, fo:table-cell 5, fo:table-column 4, fo:table-row 3, fo:table-body 2, fo:table-header 1, fo:table-footer 0. Used in tables to decide, by a ranking per element, which of the borders of adjacent cells and of the table frame is drawn.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">border-start-precedence</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.28.6</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>When table borders are collapsed (border-collapse="collapse-with-precedence"), specifies the precedence of this element's start-side border. The value is force or an integer; the larger wins. force takes precedence over any integer. The initial value differs by element: fo:table 6, fo:table-cell 5, fo:table-column 4, fo:table-row 3, fo:table-body 2, fo:table-header 1, fo:table-footer 0. Used in tables to decide, by a ranking per element, which of the borders of adjacent cells and of the table frame is drawn.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">glyph-orientation-horizontal</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.29</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>In horizontal text, specifies the orientation of the glyphs as 0, 90, 180 or 270 degrees. Used to typeset rotated glyphs within horizontal text.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">text-altitude</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.29</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the "height" of the font above the baseline as a length or percentage, in place of the font's value (use-font-metrics). Used to set the size of the upper part of the area instead of taking it from the font.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">text-depth</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.29</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the "depth" of the font below the baseline as a length or percentage, in place of the font's value (use-font-metrics). Used to set the size of the lower part of the area instead of taking it from the font.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">intrinsic-scale-value</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.30</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies, as a percentage, the scale that the actual size of the graphic corresponds to. The scale output by fo:scaling-value-citation is the scale applied to the graphic multiplied by this value. Used, when showing the scale with fo:scaling-value-citation, to convey the scale of the graphic's actual size itself.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">page-citation-strategy</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.30</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies which pages are counted by elements that cite page numbers (fo:page-number-citation and so on). all includes blank pages generated by the cited place, normal counts pages with normal areas, and non-blank excludes blank pages. Used to decide whether blank pages before or after the cited range are included in the cited pages.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">scale-option</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.30</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>In fo:scaling-value-citation, specifies whether the scale applied to the width (width) or to the height (height) is output. Used, when showing the scale of a graphic, to choose which to output when the width and height scales differ.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">score-spaces</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.30</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies whether text-decoration (underlines and so on) is drawn across spaces too (true) or not (false). Used to keep underlines and the like from being drawn across the spaces between words.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="8.8pt" color="#23313a" space-before="4mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always">Properties not relevant to print (31 items)</fo:block>
<fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"><fo:table-column column-width="36mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Name</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Description</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">azimuth</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The value is an angle, or words such as left-side, left, center, right and right-side with behind, or leftwards or rightwards (XSL 1.1 §7.7.1 cites the CSS2 definition). Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">cue-after</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The value is a URI or none (XSL 1.1 §7.7.2 cites the CSS2 definition). XSL makes the URI value an &lt;uri-specification&gt;. Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">cue-before</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The value is a URI or none (XSL 1.1 §7.7.3 cites the CSS2 definition). XSL makes the URI value an &lt;uri-specification&gt;. Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">elevation</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The value is an angle, or below, level, above, higher or lower (XSL 1.1 §7.7.4 cites the CSS2 definition). Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">pause-after</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The value is a time or a percentage (XSL 1.1 §7.7.5 cites the CSS2 definition). Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">pause-before</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The value is a time or a percentage (XSL 1.1 §7.7.6 cites the CSS2 definition). Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">pitch</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The value is a frequency, or x-low, low, medium, high or x-high (XSL 1.1 §7.7.7 cites the CSS2 definition). Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">pitch-range</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The value is a number (initial value 50) (XSL 1.1 §7.7.8 cites the CSS2 definition). Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">play-during</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The value is a URI (optionally with mix and repeat), auto or none (XSL 1.1 §7.7.9 cites the CSS2 definition). XSL makes the URI value an &lt;uri-specification&gt;. Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">richness</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The value is a number (initial value 50) (XSL 1.1 §7.7.10 cites the CSS2 definition). Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">speak</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The values are normal, none and spell-out (XSL 1.1 §7.7.11 cites the CSS2 definition). Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">speak-header</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The values are once and always (XSL 1.1 §7.7.12 cites the CSS2 definition). Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">speak-numeral</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The values are digits and continuous (XSL 1.1 §7.7.13 cites the CSS2 definition). Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">speak-punctuation</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The values are code and none (XSL 1.1 §7.7.14 cites the CSS2 definition). Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">speech-rate</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The value is a number, or x-slow, slow, medium, fast, x-fast, faster or slower (XSL 1.1 §7.7.15 cites the CSS2 definition). Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">stress</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The value is a number (initial value 50) (XSL 1.1 §7.7.16 cites the CSS2 definition). Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">voice-family</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The value is a list of specific or generic voice names (XSL 1.1 §7.7.17 cites the CSS2 definition). Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">volume</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.7</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A property for aural output (Media: aural). The value is a number or percentage, or silent, x-soft, soft, medium, loud or x-loud (XSL 1.1 §7.7.18 cites the CSS2 definition). Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">active-state</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.23</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the state in which an fo:multi-property-set applies. The values are link (a link not yet visited), visited, active, hover and focus. The medium is interactive. Used in documents viewed on screen to change the appearance according to the state of a link.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto-restore</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.23</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies whether an fo:multi-switch, when hidden by the switching of an outer fo:multi-switch, returns to its first fo:multi-case (true) or keeps the current one (false). The medium is interactive. Used in documents viewed on screen to build a mechanism that switches the display.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">case-name</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.23</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The name given to an fo:multi-case. fo:multi-toggle uses it to choose the fo:multi-case to switch to. The medium is interactive. Used in documents viewed on screen to build a mechanism that switches the display.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">case-title</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.23</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A descriptive title for an fo:multi-case. When an fo:multi-toggle has several targets, it can be shown in a menu to stand for the fo:multi-case. The medium is interactive. Used in documents viewed on screen to build a mechanism that switches the display.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">destination-placement-offset</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.23</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies, when a link is followed, the distance from the top of the page to the line containing the first area of the link target. The medium is interactive. Used in documents viewed on screen to decide at what height in the window the link target is shown.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">indicate-destination</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.23</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies whether, when a link is followed, the target area is indicated (by highlighting and so on). How it is indicated depends on the processor. The medium is interactive. Used in documents viewed on screen to make the location of the link target stand out.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">show-destination</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.23</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies whether the link target replaces the current view (replace) or opens in a new view (new). The medium is interactive. Used in documents viewed on screen to open the link target in a separate window.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">switch-to</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.23</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies which fo:multi-case to switch to when the fo:multi-toggle is activated. The value is xsl-preceding, xsl-following, xsl-any, or a list of case-name names. The medium is interactive. Used in documents viewed on screen to build a mechanism that switches the display.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">target-presentation-context</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.23</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>When the link target is a kind of resource that is processed before being shown (XML and so on), specifies by URI the context that limits what is shown. The initial value uses the target-processing-context specification. The medium is interactive. Used in documents viewed on screen to show only part of the target document.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">target-processing-context</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.23</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>When the link target is a kind of resource that is processed before being shown (XML, SVG and so on), specifies by URI the root of the virtual document to be processed. The initial value document-root uses the root of that document. The medium is interactive. Used in documents viewed on screen to have part of the target document processed as the root.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">target-stylesheet</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.23</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies by URI the stylesheet used when processing the target resource of a link. The initial value use-normal-stylesheet uses the one found in the normal way. The medium is interactive. Used in documents viewed on screen to have the target resource shown with a fixed stylesheet.</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">cue</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.31</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A shorthand that sets the aural properties cue-before and cue-after together. The medium is aural (speech). Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">pause</fo:inline><fo:block/><fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">XSL 1.1 §7.31</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A shorthand that sets the aural properties pause-before and pause-after together. The value is a time or a percentage, and the medium is aural (speech). Used when a document is output as speech (read aloud).</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><!--/gen:unsupported-->

      <!-- ──────────────── Appendix A -->
      <fo:block id="app-axf" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">AH Formatter extensions (axf:)</fo:marker><!--tab:A--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="195.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">A</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="195.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">A</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">A</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">AH Formatter extensions (axf:)</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">So that XSL-FO documents written for AH Formatter can be typeset as well, Kumiori interprets the commonly used axf: extensions (namespace http://www.antennahouse.com/names/XSL/Extensions, prefix axf:). Among the extension elements, it interprets axf:space-start-punctuation and axf:space-end-punctuation (as well as their earlier names axf:space-before-punctuation and axf:space-after-punctuation), axf:space-between-punctuation-and-digit and axf:space-between-digit-and-punctuation inside fo:declarations, and axf:document-info. The descriptions in this appendix are Kumiori's own account, in its own words, of how it interprets each extension and what it typesets as a result. The same holds for the tables of value meanings.</fo:block>

      <fo:block id="s-A-1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.1 </fo:inline>axf:border-radius and axf:box-shadow<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">axf:border-radius specifies the radius that rounds the corners of a box; axf:box-shadow specifies the shadow the box casts.</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">The per-corner radii (axf:border-top-left-radius, axf:border-top-right-radius, axf:border-bottom-right-radius and axf:border-bottom-left-radius) are interpreted as well. The chapter tabs on the outer edge of this document round only the two corners facing the inside of the page.</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="axf-radius" mark="axf:border-radius=&quot;6pt&quot;|axf:box-shadow=&quot;2pt 2pt 3pt #9a8f80&quot;"?>
<fo:block axf:border-radius="6pt" axf:box-shadow="2pt 2pt 3pt #9a8f80"
    border="1pt solid #1f3a5f" background-color="#eef2f8" padding="6pt"
    margin-left="0mm" margin-right="40mm">
  角を丸め、影を付けた囲み
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

                        <!--gen:ahadd-s-A-1-x14--><fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">For axf:border-radius and the per-corner radii, lengths are interpreted; percentages and the value diagonal are not. For axf:box-shadow, every comma-separated shadow is drawn, using its horizontal and vertical offsets, blur, spread and color (blur is drawn by layering faint shadows of gradually changing size). A shadow with inset is drawn as an inner shadow (inside the padding box).</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:border-radius</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The radius that rounds the corner, as a length. The first value is the radius in the horizontal direction (vertical in vertical writing).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The radius as a percentage of the size of the border box.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">second value</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The radius in the other direction. When omitted, it is the same as the first value.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">diagonal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Cuts the corner off with a straight diagonal line instead of rounding it.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:border-top-left-radius</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The radius that rounds the corner, as a length. The first value is the radius in the horizontal direction (vertical in vertical writing).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The radius as a percentage of the size of the border box.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">second value</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The radius in the other direction. When omitted, it is the same as the first value.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">diagonal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Cuts the corner off with a straight diagonal line instead of rounding it.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:border-top-right-radius</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The radius that rounds the corner, as a length. The first value is the radius in the horizontal direction (vertical in vertical writing).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The radius as a percentage of the size of the border box.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">second value</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The radius in the other direction. When omitted, it is the same as the first value.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">diagonal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Cuts the corner off with a straight diagonal line instead of rounding it.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:border-bottom-right-radius</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The radius that rounds the corner, as a length. The first value is the radius in the horizontal direction (vertical in vertical writing).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The radius as a percentage of the size of the border box.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">second value</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The radius in the other direction. When omitted, it is the same as the first value.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">diagonal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Cuts the corner off with a straight diagonal line instead of rounding it.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:border-bottom-left-radius</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The radius that rounds the corner, as a length. The first value is the radius in the horizontal direction (vertical in vertical writing).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The radius as a percentage of the size of the border box.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">second value</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The radius in the other direction. When omitted, it is the same as the first value.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">diagonal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Cuts the corner off with a straight diagonal line instead of rounding it.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:box-shadow</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>No shadow is drawn.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">inset</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Casts the shadow inside the box instead of outside it.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (drawn inside the padding box)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">1st and 2nd &lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The horizontal (positive is right) and vertical (positive is down) offsets of the shadow.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">3rd &lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The width by which the edge of the shadow is blurred (0 or more).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">4th &lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The amount by which the shadow is spread on all sides (a negative value shrinks it).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;color&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The color the shadow is painted in.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">,</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Separating values with commas stacks several shadows.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>
<!--/gen:ahadd-s-A-1-x14-->
      <fo:block id="s-A-2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.2 </fo:inline>axf:diagonal-border and axf:reverse-diagonal-border<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">axf:diagonal-border-color specifies the color of the diagonal rule drawn across a table cell. The line style and width are specified with axf:diagonal-border-style and axf:diagonal-border-width.</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="axf-diagonal" mark="axf:diagonal-border-style=&quot;solid&quot;|axf:diagonal-border-width=&quot;0.6pt&quot;|axf:diagonal-border-color=&quot;#b5562b&quot;"?>
<fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="60mm" border-collapse="collapse"
    font-size="8pt">
  <fo:table-column column-width="20mm" number-columns-repeated="3"/>
  <fo:table-body>
    <fo:table-row height="10mm">
      <fo:table-cell border="0.6pt solid #1f3a5f" axf:diagonal-border-style="solid"
          axf:diagonal-border-width="0.6pt" axf:diagonal-border-color="#b5562b">
        <fo:block/></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell border="0.6pt solid #1f3a5f" padding="2pt">
        <fo:block>列 1</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
      <fo:table-cell border="0.6pt solid #1f3a5f" padding="2pt">
        <fo:block>列 2</fo:block></fo:table-cell>
    </fo:table-row>
  </fo:table-body>
</fo:table>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

                        <!--gen:ahadd-s-A-2-x14--><fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">For the diagonal rule (axf:diagonal-border-*) and the reverse diagonal rule (axf:reverse-diagonal-border-*), the line style, width and color are interpreted, as are the shorthands axf:diagonal-border and axf:reverse-diagonal-border. No rule is drawn when the style is none or hidden.</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:diagonal-border-color</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;color&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The color of the diagonal rule (the line drawn from the top-left to the bottom-right of a table cell). When not specified, the value of color.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: when not specified, the rule is drawn in black rather than in the value of color</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:diagonal-border-style</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;border-style&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The line style of the diagonal rule (none, solid, dashed and so on; the initial value is none).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (not drawn for none or hidden)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:diagonal-border-width</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;border-width&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The width of the diagonal rule: thin, medium, thick or a length (initial value medium).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:reverse-diagonal-border-color</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;color&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The color of the reverse diagonal rule (the line drawn from the bottom-left to the top-right of a table cell). When not specified, the value of color.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: when not specified, the rule is drawn in black rather than in the value of color</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:reverse-diagonal-border-style</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;border-style&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The line style of the reverse diagonal rule (none, solid, dashed and so on; the initial value is none).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (not drawn for none or hidden)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:reverse-diagonal-border-width</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;border-width&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The width of the reverse diagonal rule: thin, medium, thick or a length (initial value medium).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>
<!--/gen:ahadd-s-A-2-x14-->
      <fo:block id="s-A-3" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.3 </fo:inline>axf:text-autospace and axf:punctuation-trim<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">axf:text-autospace specifies whether spacing is inserted between Japanese and Latin text; axf:punctuation-trim specifies whether the spacing of full-width punctuation is compressed.</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="axf-autospace" mark="axf:text-autospace=&quot;none&quot;|axf:text-autospace=&quot;ideograph-alpha ideograph-numeric&quot;|axf:punctuation-trim=&quot;none&quot;|axf:punctuation-trim=&quot;start end adjacent&quot;"?>
<fo:block axf:text-autospace="none">空き無し: 和文とKumioriの間、2026年。</fo:block>
<fo:block axf:text-autospace="ideograph-alpha ideograph-numeric">空き有り:
  和文とKumioriの間、2026年。</fo:block>
<fo:block axf:punctuation-trim="none" space-before="3pt">「詰めない」（括弧）、「約物」。</fo:block>
<fo:block axf:punctuation-trim="start end adjacent">「詰める」（括弧）、「約物」。</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

                        <!--gen:ahadd-s-A-3-x6--><fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">"Specifies the amount of spacing between Japanese and Latin text." (axf:text-autospace-width). Kumiori interprets a length (including em) and uses it as the amount of spacing that axf:text-autospace inserts. Percentages are not interpreted.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">"In Japanese, specifies the compressed spacing between full-width punctuation and full-width characters." (axf:punctuation-spacing). Lengths and percentages of the font size are interpreted and used as the spacing that remains when, for example, the gap between a closing and an opening bracket is compressed.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">For axf:punctuation-trim, each of the space-separated keywords is interpreted on its own (see the table below). Strings (&lt;string&gt;) are not interpreted.</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:text-autospace-width</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The amount of spacing inserted between Japanese and Latin text, as a length.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The amount of spacing as a percentage of the font size.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported: the value is ignored</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Leaves the amount of spacing to the formatter's default.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported: the value is ignored</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:punctuation-spacing</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The spacing left when punctuation is compressed, as a length.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The spacing as a percentage of the font size.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Leaves the spacing to the formatter's default.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: the value is ignored (the default spacing is half an em)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:punctuation-trim</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Full-width punctuation is not compressed.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">start</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Full-width punctuation at the start of a line, such as an opening bracket, is reduced to half width.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">start-except-first</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Same as start, except on the first line of a paragraph and on lines right after a forced line break.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>When text is end-aligned or justified, full-width punctuation at the end of a line, such as a closing bracket, is always reduced to half width.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: closing brackets and punctuation marks at the end of a line are reduced to half width regardless of the value of text-align</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">allow-end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>In the same situations as end, the punctuation stays full width if it fits on the line and is reduced to half width only when it does not.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (not discarded at the end of the line; reduced to half width when text that does not fit is pulled in)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">end-except-fullstop</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Same as end, but full stops (U+3002 and U+FF0E) are not compressed.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">adjacent</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Compresses the spacing where punctuation marks are adjacent, such as between a closing and an opening bracket.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">all</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>All brackets, middle dots and punctuation marks are compressed to half width.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;string&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The characters written here are also compressed. It can be written alongside the keywords.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported: strings are ignored (only the keywords are interpreted)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Leaves the compression policy to the formatter's default.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: treated the same as when nothing is specified (compatibility mode compresses consecutive punctuation, the start of the first line of a paragraph and line ends; spec mode compresses nothing)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>
<!--/gen:ahadd-s-A-3-x6-->
      <fo:block id="s-A-4" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.4 </fo:inline>axf:hanging-punctuation<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">axf:hanging-punctuation specifies whether punctuation protrudes at the start of a line or hangs at the end of a line.</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="axf-hanging" mark="axf:hanging-punctuation=&quot;allow-end&quot;"?>
<fo:block axf:hanging-punctuation="allow-end" width="44mm" margin-right="80mm"
    border-end-style="solid" border-end-width="0.4pt" border-end-color="#b5562b"
    font-size="9.5pt" text-align="justify">
  行の終わりに句点がくるとき、ぶら下げて組みます。あいうえおかきくけこさしす。
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

                        <!--gen:ahadd-s-A-4-x6--><fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">Every value other than none hangs punctuation marks (、。，．) that do not fit on the line beyond the end of the line. The values are not distinguished from one another, and no protrusion at the start of a line (start, first) is done.</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:hanging-punctuation</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Neither protrusion at the start of a line nor hanging at the end of a line.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">start</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Punctuation at the start of a line protrudes beyond the start edge of the line.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: no protrusion; punctuation hangs at the end of the line instead (same as allow-end)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">first</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The same protrusion as start, but only on the first line of a paragraph.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: no protrusion; punctuation hangs at the end of the line instead (same as allow-end)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">force-end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>When text is end-aligned or justified, an eligible character at the end of a line always hangs beyond the end edge of the line.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: not distinguished from allow-end</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">allow-end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>When text is end-aligned or justified, only an eligible character that does not fit on the line hangs beyond the end edge of the line.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (、。，． are hung)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">last</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The same hanging as force-end, but only on the last line of a paragraph (applies to quotation marks, closing brackets, periods, commas and hyphens).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: punctuation marks (、。，．) that do not fit on the line are hung, not only at the end of a paragraph</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>
<!--/gen:ahadd-s-A-4-x6-->
      <fo:block id="s-A-5" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.5 </fo:inline>axf:line-number<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">axf:line-number specifies whether line numbers are shown. How they are shown is specified with the axf:line-number-* properties.</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="axf-line-number" mark="axf:line-number=&quot;show&quot;"?>
<fo:block axf:line-number="show" margin-left="10mm">
  行番号を付けた段落です。行番号は、行の始めの外側に出ます。長い段落では、行ごとに番号が付きます。もう少し文を続けて、行を三つ以上にします。三行目にも番号が付くことを確かめるために、この段落はわざと長めに書いています。
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

                        <!--gen:ahadd-s-A-5-x10--><fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">Line numbering counts the lines of the blocks that specify show or hide for axf:line-number and places the numbers outside the edge of the column. The font, size, color, side and distance from the line (axf:line-number-font-family, -font-size, -color, -position, -offset and so on) are specified on the block; the format, starting number, interval, first shown number and reset (axf:line-number-format, -initial, -interval, -start, -reset) are specified on fo:page-sequence. Specifications on fo:table-column are not interpreted.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">When no reset is specified, counting restarts from 1 on every page. Unlike the meaning of the initial value auto (carry over from the previous fo:page-sequence), the count of the previous fo:page-sequence is not carried over.</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:line-number</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>No line numbers.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">show</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Line numbers are added and shown.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">hide</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Line numbers are counted but not shown.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:line-number-color</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;color&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The color of the line numbers. When not specified, the value of color.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:line-number-font-family</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">[ &lt;family-name&gt; | &lt;generic-family&gt; ]#</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The list of font names used for the line numbers.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:line-number-font-size</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The font size of the line numbers, as a length.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>As a percentage of the font size of the text.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;absolute-size&gt; | &lt;relative-size&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>As a keyword such as medium, small or larger (initial value medium).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:line-number-font-style</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Line numbers in upright (non-italic) type.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">italic</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Line numbers in italic.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:line-number-font-weight</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal | bold</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Line numbers in normal weight or in bold.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">bolder | lighter</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>One step bolder or lighter than the parent.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported (treated as normal)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">1...1000</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The weight as a number.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:line-number-format</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;string&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The numbering style of the line numbers (1, 01, a, i and so on; the same notation as the format property; initial value 1).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:line-number-initial</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The starting number is carried over from the previous fo:page-sequence (1 when there is no previous one).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: counting starts from 1 (nothing is carried over from the previous fo:page-sequence)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;number&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The starting number (1 or more). The count returns to this value whenever axf:line-number-reset calls for a reset.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">#&lt;id&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Written on fo:table-column, continues the line numbers of the fo:table-column with that id.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:line-number-interval</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Carried over from the previous fo:page-sequence (1 when there is no previous one).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: treated as 1 (nothing is carried over from the previous fo:page-sequence)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;number&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The interval between the lines whose numbers are shown (5 means every 5th line).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:line-number-offset</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The space between the edge of the column and the line number (initial value 0pt).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:line-number-position</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">start</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Line numbers are placed on the start side of the line.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Line numbers are placed on the end side of the line.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">inside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>On the start side on odd pages and on the end side on even pages (the spine side).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">outside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>On the end side on odd pages and on the start side on even pages (the outer edge).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">alternate</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>In a multi-column layout, on the end side for the last column only and on the start side for the other columns. Without columns, on the start side.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: the start and end sides alternate column by column (in a two-column layout this matches the meaning of alternate)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:line-number-reset</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Carried over from the previous fo:page-sequence (none when there is no previous one).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: same as page, counting restarts on every page</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Line numbers are never reset.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Counting restarts on every new page.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">column</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Counting also restarts in every new column.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">force</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Written on fo:block, restarts counting from that block.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:line-number-start</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Carried over from the previous fo:page-sequence (1 when there is no previous one).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: numbers are shown from the starting number (axf:line-number-initial) onward</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;number&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Line numbers are shown only on lines with this number or higher.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>
<!--/gen:ahadd-s-A-5-x10-->
      <fo:block id="s-A-6" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.6 </fo:inline>column-count and column-gap (multi-column layout inside a block)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">column-count and column-gap can be written not only on fo:region-body but also on fo:block-container. They can also be written under their axf:-prefixed names.</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="axf-columns" mark="axf:column-count=&quot;3&quot;|axf:column-gap=&quot;5mm&quot;|axf:column-rule-style=&quot;solid&quot;|axf:column-rule-width=&quot;0.4pt&quot;|axf:column-rule-color=&quot;#9fb0cc&quot;"?>
<fo:block-container axf:column-count="3" axf:column-gap="5mm"
    axf:column-rule-style="solid" axf:column-rule-width="0.4pt"
    axf:column-rule-color="#9fb0cc">
  <fo:block>ブロックの中を 3 段に分けます。段と段の間には罫線を引いています。文は左の段から右の段へ流れ、段の高さはそろえられます。段組の見本のために、少し文を続けます。字と行と段を組み合わせて紙面を作ります。</fo:block>
</fo:block-container>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

                        <!--gen:ahadd-s-A-6-x13--><fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">For multi-column layout in fo:block-container, column-count and column-gap are also interpreted under the names axf:column-count and axf:column-gap. For column rules, axf:column-rule-style, axf:column-rule-width and axf:column-rule-color are interpreted on both fo:region-body and fo:block-container. Of axf:column-rule-display, only the value all on fo:block-container is interpreted; of axf:column-fill (also under the name column-fill), only the value balance on fo:region-body. The shorthand axf:column-rule, as well as axf:column-rule-align and axf:column-rule-length, are not interpreted.</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:column-count</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;number&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The number of columns (XSL initial value 1). Can be written on fo:block-container as well as on fo:region-body.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (on fo:block-container, the name axf:column-count is also interpreted)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:column-gap</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The space between columns (XSL initial value 12pt).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The space as a percentage of the width of the fo:block-container.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: only when specified on fo:block-container</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:column-fill</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Columns are filled in order from the first without balancing their heights. Before a spanning block (span="all") they are balanced.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (columns are also filled in order when nothing is specified)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">balance</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Content is distributed so that the columns are of equal height (initial value).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: only when specified on fo:region-body</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">balance-all</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Column heights are balanced within each fragment split across pages.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:column-rule</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;border-width&gt; || &lt;border-style&gt; || &lt;color&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Writes the width, line style and color of the column rule together.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;column-rule-display&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The extent of the rule (a value of axf:column-rule-display) can be written together with them.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:column-rule-align</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">before</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Aligns the column rule to the before side of the columns (the top in horizontal writing).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">center</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places the column rule at the center of the columns in the block direction (initial value).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">after</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Aligns the column rule to the after side of the columns (the bottom in horizontal writing).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:column-rule-color</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;color&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The color of the column rule. When not specified, the value of color.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: when not specified, the rule is drawn in black rather than in the value of color</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:column-rule-display</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">gap</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Draws a column rule only between columns that have content (initial value).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (the initial behavior; the same when nothing is specified)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Draws a rule on the end side of each column that has content (except the end-most column).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">all</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Draws a rule between all columns, including where the columns are empty.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: only when specified on fo:block-container</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:column-rule-length</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The length of the column rule, as a length.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The length of the column rule as a percentage of the column height (initial value 100%).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:column-rule-style</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;border-style&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The line style of the column rule (initial value none; with none no rule is drawn).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (not drawn with none or hidden)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:column-rule-width</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;border-width&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The width of the column rule, as thin, medium, thick or a length (initial value medium).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>
