      <fo:block id="s-A-7" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.7 </fo:inline>axf:revision-bar-*<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
      <fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">axf:revision-bar-color specifies the color of the revision bar (the vertical line drawn beside changed passages).</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample id="axf-revision" mark="axf:revision-bar-style=&quot;solid&quot;|axf:revision-bar-color=&quot;#d9472b&quot;|axf:revision-bar-width=&quot;1.5pt&quot;|axf:revision-bar-offset=&quot;3mm&quot;|axf:revision-bar-position=&quot;start&quot;"?>
<fo:block>改訂の無い行。</fo:block>
<fo:block axf:revision-bar-style="solid" axf:revision-bar-color="#d9472b"
    axf:revision-bar-width="1.5pt" axf:revision-bar-offset="3mm"
    axf:revision-bar-position="start">
  改訂した段落には、行の外側に改訂バーが付きます。
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

                                          <!--gen:ahadd-s-A-7-x11--><fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">A revision bar is drawn beside blocks and inlines whose axf:revision-bar-style is a line style other than none or hidden. When specified on an inline, it is drawn outside the lines that contain the inline. The specification is inherited by children; consecutive lines with the same specification are joined into a single bar, which is placed axf:revision-bar-offset away from the edge of the column.</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:revision-bar-color</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;color&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The color of the revision bar. When not specified, the value of color.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:revision-bar-offset</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The space between the edge of the column and the revision bar (initial value 0pt).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:revision-bar-position</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">start</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places the revision bar on the start side of the line.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places the revision bar on the end side of the line.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">inside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places it on the start side on odd pages and on the end side on even pages (the spine side).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">outside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places it on the end side on odd pages and on the start side on even pages (the fore-edge side).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">alternate</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>In a multi-column layout, places it on the end side in the last column only and on the start side in the other columns.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: alternates between the start and end sides from column to column (with two columns this matches the meaning of alternate)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">both</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Places it on both the start and end sides.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:revision-bar-style</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;border-style&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The line style of the revision bar (initial value none; with none no bar is drawn).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (not drawn with none or hidden)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:revision-bar-width</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;border-width&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The width of the revision bar, as thin, medium, thick or a length (initial value medium).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: thin, medium, thick and lengths are supported. When not specified, the bar is drawn at 1pt rather than medium (3pt when the line style is double, groove or ridge, and under --compat antenna)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>
<!--/gen:ahadd-s-A-7-x11-->
      <!--gen:ahsec--><fo:block id="s-A-x1" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.8 </fo:inline>axf:outline-level, axf:outline-title and axf:outline-group (bookmarks)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#b08132" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Partial</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">axf:outline-level specifies the depth, in the PDF bookmark hierarchy, of the bookmark made from the element.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">An fo:block carrying axf:outline-level becomes an entry in the PDF bookmarks. The bookmark leads to the page on which the block lies (an id is added to the block if it has none). The bookmark title is the string of <fo:inline keep-together.within-line="always">axf:outline-title</fo:inline>, or the text of the block if there is none. Specifications on fo:inline, fo:block-container and the like are ignored.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">Bookmarks given the same group name with axf:outline-group are gathered under an entry whose title is the group name. Bookmarks without a group name are listed together outside the groups. The standard fo:bookmark-tree is interpreted as well; when both are present, these bookmarks follow those of the fo:bookmark-tree.</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:outline-level</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;number&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The depth in the bookmark hierarchy: 1 for the top level, with larger integers for deeper levels.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: only specifications on fo:block are interpreted</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">0</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. No bookmark entry is made.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:outline-title</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;string&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The title shown in the bookmark.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">empty string</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. When no title is written, the text of the element becomes the bookmark title.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: when omitted, the text of the block becomes the title, but specifying an empty string gives a bookmark with an empty title</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:outline-group</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;string&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The name of the group the bookmark belongs to. Entries with the same name are gathered into one group.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (gathered under an entry whose title is the group name)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">empty string</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. The bookmark is not grouped (ungrouped entries are listed together as one unnamed set).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: as described when omitted, but specifying an empty string gathers the bookmarks under an entry with an empty title</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>
<fo:block id="s-A-x2" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.9 </fo:inline>axf:annotation-* (PDF annotations)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#b08132" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Partial</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">axf:annotation-type specifies the kind of PDF annotation attached to the element.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">A PDF annotation is attached to fo:block, fo:inline, fo:basic-link and fo:wrapper elements that carry axf:annotation-type. Specifications on fo:block-container, fo:table, fo:external-graphic and the like are ignored. The names of the annotation types are case-insensitive.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">A text annotation is made of a 20pt-square icon and a popup of the size given by axf:annotation-width and axf:annotation-height. A free text annotation draws the text of axf:annotation-contents, in a font embedded in the document, inside a box filled with the annotation color. The position of the annotation can be offset from the top-left corner of the region with axf:annotation-position-horizontal and axf:annotation-position-vertical.</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:annotation-type</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">empty string</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. No annotation is attached.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">Text</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A text annotation (an icon with a popup).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">FreeText</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A free text annotation (text placed directly on the page).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">Stamp</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A rubber stamp annotation.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">FileAttachment</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A file attachment annotation.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (the file in axf:annotation-file-attachment is embedded in the PDF; if the file is not found, a text annotation is made and a warning is given)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">Highlight / Underline / StrikeOut / Squiggly</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Highlight, underline, strikeout and squiggly-underline annotations on text. They have no effect on blocks that produce no lines.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported (no annotation is made)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:annotation-title</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;string&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The title of the annotation (PDF 1.5 and later).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:annotation-contents</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;string&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The text shown in the annotation.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:annotation-color</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;color&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The color of the annotation background and the like (translucent colors cannot be used).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. No color is set.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:annotation-flags</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;string&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>PDF annotation flags (Invisible, Hidden, Print, NoZoom, NoRotate, NoView, ReadOnly, Locked, ToggleNoView and LockedContents of ISO 32000), separated by white space. Case-insensitive.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:annotation-open</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">true</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Opens the annotation popup initially (for Text, Highlight, Underline, StrikeOut and Squiggly).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">false</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. The popup is closed.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:annotation-icon-name</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;string&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The name of the annotation icon. The standard PDF names are Comment, Help, Insert, Key, NewParagraph, Note and Paragraph for Text; Approved, Draft, Final, Confidential and others for Stamp; and Graph, Paperclip, PushPin and Tag for FileAttachment.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">empty string</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. Text becomes Note, Stamp becomes Draft and FileAttachment becomes PushPin.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:annotation-position-horizontal</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The distance from the left edge of the region to the position of the annotation (popup, icon or stamp) (initial value 0pt).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:annotation-position-vertical</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The distance from the top edge of the region to the position of the annotation (popup, icon or stamp) (initial value 0pt).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:annotation-width</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The width of a popup or stamp annotation.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (also used as the width of a free text annotation)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. No width is set.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (treated as 100pt)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:annotation-height</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The height of a popup or stamp annotation.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (also used as the height of a free text annotation)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. No height is set.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (treated as 60pt)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:annotation-font-size</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The font size of a free text annotation. The initial value is left to the implementation.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (10pt when not specified)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>As a percentage of the font size of the element.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported (treated as 10pt)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;absolute-size&gt; / &lt;relative-size&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>As a keyword such as large or smaller.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported (treated as 10pt)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:annotation-text-color</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;color&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The text color of a free text annotation. The initial value is left to the implementation.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (black when not specified)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>

<?kumiori-sample id="axfx-2" mark="axf:annotation-type=&quot;Text&quot;|axf:annotation-type=&quot;FreeText&quot;|axf:annotation-contents"?>
<fo:block axf:annotation-type="Text" axf:annotation-title="校閲"
    axf:annotation-contents="「組み方」に直します。" axf:annotation-color="#b5562b"
    axf:annotation-position-horizontal="80mm">
  テキスト注釈を付けたブロック (右にアイコン)
</fo:block>
<fo:block space-before="12pt">
  <fo:inline axf:annotation-type="FreeText"
      axf:annotation-contents="フリーテキスト注釈" axf:annotation-color="#c3ccc8"
      axf:annotation-text-color="#23313a" axf:annotation-font-size="7pt"
      axf:annotation-position-horizontal="80mm" axf:annotation-width="30mm"
      axf:annotation-height="4.5mm">フリーテキスト注釈を付けたインライン</fo:inline>
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

<fo:block id="s-A-x3" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.10 </fo:inline>axf:form and axf:form-field (PDF form fields)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#b08132" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Partial</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">axf:form-field is the element that places a PDF form field (a text field, button, choice and so on).</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">axf:form-field places a box with a border, a background and a size inside the line, and creates a PDF form field at that position. Kumiori draws the border and the background on the page. When no size is given, checkboxes and radio buttons are one em square, buttons take the width of their caption, and other fields are 100pt wide. Radio buttons with the same axf:field-name form one group.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">axf:form passes the destination (external-destination) and the method (axf:field-submit-method) to the submit buttons (axf:action-type="submit") inside it. A submit button outside an axf:form gets no action. For axf:action-type, Kumiori interprets submit and reset on buttons. Values given on fo:basic-link (auto, gotor, launch, uri) are not interpreted; the action of an external link is decided by the form of its destination (a URL with a scheme is a URI action, a relative PDF is GoToR, and other relative files are Launch). The scheme of the submit URL follows the same rule as links (by default http, https, mailto and tel; a submit URL with another scheme gets no action).</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">Field properties are written with the axf: prefix (axf:field-type and so on). field-type, field-submit-method and the like written without axf: are not interpreted (field-value on axf:form-field-option is the one exception: it is interpreted without axf: as well).</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-submit-method</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">get</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. Sends the form contents with GET.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: when nothing is specified, the form is sent with POST (GET only when get is written explicitly)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">post</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Sends the form contents with POST.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-type</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">text</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A field for entering text.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">button</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A push button.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">checkbox</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A checkbox.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">radio</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A radio button.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">listbox</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A list box for choosing from a list.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">combobox</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A choice field that also accepts typed input (a combo box).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">signature</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A digital signature field.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported (treated as a text field)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-name</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;string&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The name of the field. When omitted, the formatter assigns a name.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (when omitted, the name is built from the field type and a sequence number; when names collide, _2 and so on is appended to the later field)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-description</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;string&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A description of the field, shown as a tooltip by PDF viewers.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported (not written to the PDF)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-value</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;string&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The value of the field, used when submitting and so on (written on axf:form-field and axf:form-field-option).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: used as the value of radio buttons and choice items (axf:form-field-option); not used for checkboxes</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-readonly</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">false</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. The field accepts input.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">true</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Makes the field read-only, so it accepts no input.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: takes effect on text fields only</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-required</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">false</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. Input is optional.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">true</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Makes input required.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: takes effect on text fields only</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-default-text</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;string&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The text initially present in a text field. Characters beyond axf:field-maxlen are discarded.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: when it exceeds axf:field-maxlen, the field cannot be created and only the box remains</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-multiline</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">false</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. A single-line field.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">true</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A field that accepts several lines of input.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-password</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">false</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. Typed characters are shown as they are.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">true</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>A password field; typed characters are hidden behind * or the like.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-maxlen</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;number&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The maximum number of characters a text field accepts. 0 or less (the initial value is 0) sets no limit.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-font-size</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">font-size</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. Uses the font-size of the element.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Leaves the size undecided and lets the viewer adjust it automatically.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Gives the font size as a length.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-button-face</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;string&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The text shown on a push button.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-checked</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">false</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. Shown unchecked.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">true</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Shown checked.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-checked-style</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">checkmark</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. The check mark is a tick.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">circle, square, cross, star</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The mark is a circle, a square, a cross or a star.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-top-index</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;number&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>In a list box or combo box, the number of the item selected at first (the first item is 1; the initial value is 1). A value below 1 or above the number of items is treated as 1.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-multiple</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">false</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. Only one item can be selected in a list box.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">true</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Allows several items to be selected in a list box.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-editable</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">false</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. The value of a combo box can only be chosen from the list.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">true</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Allows free input into a combo box.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:field-selected</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">false</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. Specifies nothing.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">true</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Written on axf:form-field-option, makes that item selected at first. Takes precedence over axf:field-top-index.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:action-type</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. Leaves the kind of action to the formatter's default.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: buttons get no action (an external link on fo:basic-link is always a URI action)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">goto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>An action that goes to a destination within the document (GoTo).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">gotor</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>An action that opens another PDF and goes to a position in it (GoToR) (can be written on fo:basic-link and axf:form-field).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">launch</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>An action that opens an external file with an application (Launch) (can be written on fo:basic-link and axf:form-field).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">uri</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>An action that opens a URI (URI) (can be written on fo:basic-link and axf:form-field).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: an external link on fo:basic-link is always a URI action (buttons get no action)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">reset</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>An action that resets the form input to its initial state.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">submit</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>An action that submits the form contents.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (buttons inside an axf:form only)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">javascript</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>An action that runs JavaScript (can be written on axf:form-field-event only).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>

<?kumiori-sample id="axfx-3" mark="&lt;axf:form |&lt;axf:form-field |axf:field-type=&quot;text&quot;|axf:field-type=&quot;combobox&quot;|axf:field-type=&quot;button&quot;|axf:action-type=&quot;submit&quot;|axf:action-type=&quot;reset&quot;"?>
<axf:form external-destination="https://example.com/submit"
    axf:field-submit-method="post">
  <fo:block>名前 <axf:form-field axf:field-type="text" axf:field-name="sample-name"
      axf:field-default-text="Kumiori" width="40mm" border="0.5pt solid #23313a"/>
    　<axf:form-field axf:field-type="combobox" axf:field-name="sample-size"
      width="20mm" border="0.5pt solid #23313a"
      ><axf:form-field-option>A4</axf:form-field-option><axf:form-field-option
      axf:field-selected="true">B5</axf:form-field-option></axf:form-field>
    　<axf:form-field axf:field-type="button" axf:field-name="sample-submit"
      axf:action-type="submit" axf:field-button-face="Submit"
      border="0.5pt solid #23313a" background-color="#c3ccc8"/>
    　<axf:form-field axf:field-type="button" axf:field-name="sample-reset"
      axf:action-type="reset" axf:field-button-face="Reset"
      border="0.5pt solid #23313a" background-color="#c3ccc8"/></fo:block>
</axf:form>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

<fo:block id="s-A-x4" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.11 </fo:inline>axf:printer-marks, axf:bleed and axf:crop-offset (trim marks and bleed)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#b08132" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Partial</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">axf:printer-marks specifies printer's marks such as trim marks.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">Kumiori interprets axf:printer-marks, axf:bleed, axf:crop-offset and axf:printer-marks-line-width on fo:simple-page-master, and produces a sheet with bleed and trim marks outside the trim size. The TrimBox of the PDF is the trim size, and the BleedBox extends to the bleed.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">For axf:crop-offset, one to four values (top, right, bottom, left) are interpreted, and the sheet is made larger than the trim size even without axf:printer-marks. When axf:crop-offset is absent, 10mm is taken outside the bleed. The per-side properties axf:crop-offset-top, axf:bleed-top and the like are not interpreted. The trim marks are 0.3pt thick when axf:printer-marks-line-width is absent.</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:crop-offset</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The distance from the edge of the medium (the paper) to the edge of the trim size (initial value 0pt). If smaller than axf:bleed, it is widened to the value of axf:bleed.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (one to four values for top, right, bottom and left are also interpreted)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:bleed</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The width of the bleed taken outside the trim size (initial value 0pt).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:printer-marks</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. No printer's marks are drawn.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">crop</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Draws corner trim marks at the four corners, at the trim size and, if there is bleed, at the bleed as well (Japanese-style double trim marks).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">crop-trim</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Draws corner trim marks at the trim size only.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported (no marks are drawn)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">cross</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Draws cross-shaped center marks at the middle of each side.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">cross-circle</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Draws center marks with a circle over the cross.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported (no marks are drawn)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">cross-registration</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Draws Western-style registration marks.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported (no marks are drawn)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;uri-specification&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Draws an image such as an SVG in place of the trim marks and color bars.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported (the image is not drawn)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:printer-marks-line-width</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;length&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The line width of the trim marks.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. Leaves the width to the formatter's default.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: drawn at 0.3pt</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>
<fo:block id="s-A-x5" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.12 </fo:inline>axf:line-break and white-space<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#b08132" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Partial</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">axf:line-break specifies how line break positions are decided (how strict the line-start prohibition rules are).</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">The normal and strict values of axf:line-break switch the set of characters that are prohibited at the start of a line (line-start kinsoku). strict does not allow small kana and the prolonged sound mark (ー) at the start of a line; normal does. In the example below, the upper block is normal and the lower is strict.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">For white-space, the XSL 1.1 values (normal, pre, nowrap) are interpreted. The CSS values pre-wrap and pre-line are not.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">axf:word-break and axf:word-wrap are not supported yet. Kumiori always breaks a word that does not fit on the line in the middle of the word.</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:line-break</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Treated the same as normal.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported: the value is ignored (same as strict; same as normal under --compat antenna)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Relaxes the line-start prohibition rules; small kana, the prolonged sound mark and the like may start a line.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (values combined with line or bpil are not interpreted)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">strict</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Keeps every line-start prohibited character, including small kana and the prolonged sound mark, off the start of a line.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported (values combined with line or bpil are not interpreted)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">loose</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The most relaxed line-start prohibition rules (a CSS Text 3 value).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">anywhere</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Allows a line break between any two characters (a CSS Text 3 value).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">line</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Breaks lines with the simple method that decides one line at a time.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported: a value containing line is ignored as a whole</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">bpil</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Breaks lines with the method that considers the whole paragraph (Knuth-Plass).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported: a value containing bpil is ignored as a whole</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:word-break</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Breaks words by the usual rules of each language.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported: the value is ignored</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">keep-all</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Does not break lines inside a word.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">break-all</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Allows a line break between any two characters inside a word (Latin, Cyrillic, Greek and so on).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">break-word</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Breaks a word that does not fit somewhere between its characters (a CSS value).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">keep-non-spaces</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Does not break lines anywhere but at spaces.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:word-wrap</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Does not force a break in a word that does not fit; lets it overflow the area.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported: the value is ignored and a word that does not fit is broken</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">break-word</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Breaks a word that does not fit somewhere between its characters (the XSL initial value).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: the value is not interpreted, but words are always broken as this value would</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">break-spaces</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Wraps while preserving runs of spaces (a CSS value).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">white-space</fo:inline> <fo:inline font-size="6.3pt" color="#6b7275">(CSS 2.1 §16.6)</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">pre-wrap</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Preserves spaces and line feeds as they are, and wraps lines.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported: the value is ignored</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">pre-line</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Collapses runs of spaces into one, preserves line feeds, and wraps lines.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported: the value is ignored</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>

<?kumiori-sample id="axfx-5" mark="axf:line-break=&quot;normal&quot;|axf:line-break=&quot;strict&quot;"?>
<fo:block-container width="31.5mm" border-end-style="solid"
    border-end-width="0.4pt" border-end-color="#b5562b" font-size="9pt">
  <fo:block axf:line-break="normal">新しい版をインストールします。</fo:block>
  <fo:block axf:line-break="strict" space-before="3pt">新しい版をインストールします。</fo:block>
</fo:block-container>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

<fo:block id="s-A-x6" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.13 </fo:inline>axf:kerning-mode<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#4f7a64" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Supported</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">axf:kerning-mode specifies whether kerning (tightening the spacing between characters according to the pair of glyphs) is applied.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">none applies no kerning; pair and auto apply kerning to pairs of Latin letters (the font's pair kerning). font-kerning (none applies no kerning) is interpreted the same way. In the example below, the left is none and the right is pair.</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:kerning-mode</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>No kerning is applied.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">pair</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Tightens the spacing between characters using the font's pair-kerning data.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Leaves the decision whether to kern to the formatter's default.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: kerns the same as pair</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>

<?kumiori-sample id="axfx-6" mark="axf:kerning-mode=&quot;none&quot;|axf:kerning-mode=&quot;pair&quot;"?>
<fo:block font-family="serif" font-size="14pt" color="#23313a">
  <fo:inline axf:kerning-mode="none">AVATAR, Wave</fo:inline>　<fo:inline
      axf:kerning-mode="pair" color="#b5562b">AVATAR, Wave</fo:inline>
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

<fo:block id="s-A-x8" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.14 </fo:inline>axf:physical-page-number<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#b08132" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Partial</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">axf:physical-page-number specifies whether a page-number reference outputs the physical page number, counted from the beginning of the document.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">When axf:physical-page-number="true" is set on fo:page-number-citation or fo:page-number-citation-last, the page number counted from the beginning of the document is output, independent of initial-page-number. The property is not interpreted on fo:page-number. The example below shows the folio next to the physical page number.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">The &lt;axf:counter-style&gt; element is not supported yet.</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:physical-page-number</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">true</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Outputs the physical page number counted from the beginning of the document, regardless of initial-page-number or fo:page-sequence boundaries.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: takes effect only on fo:page-number-citation and fo:page-number-citation-last</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">false</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The initial value. Outputs the ordinary page number.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>

<?kumiori-sample id="axfx-8" mark="axf:physical-page-number=&quot;true&quot;"?>
<fo:block id="ppn-sample" font-size="9pt">
  このページのノンブルは <fo:page-number/>、文書の先頭から数えたページ番号は
  <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="ppn-sample" axf:physical-page-number="true" color="#b5562b"/> です。
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

<fo:block id="s-A-x9" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.15 </fo:inline>axf:ligature-mode and font-stretch<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#b08132" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Partial</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">axf:ligature-mode specifies whether ligatures are used.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">When axf:ligature-mode is latin or all, Latin ligatures (fi, fl, ffi and so on) are used. When it is absent, or when it is none, kana, jamo or auto, Latin ligatures are not used. Kana and Hangul jamo ligatures are not supported. The sequences made into ligatures are those listed in the font's ligature table (liga of OpenType); neither their length nor the kind of character is limited, so fonts that replace words with icons (names such as home and arrow_back become one glyph) can be used. Sequences that the font has as required ligatures (rlig) become ligatures even without axf:ligature-mode. No line break or letter-spacing is inserted inside a ligature. In vertical writing, ligatures from the font's ligature table are not formed. Sequences that span a space are not made into ligatures.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">For font-stretch, in addition to the XSL 1.1 keywords, the percentages of the axf: extension (such as 75%) are interpreted and change the width of the glyphs. Numbers (&lt;number&gt;) are not interpreted. In the example below, the top line shows axf:ligature-mode none and latin, and the bottom line shows font-stretch 75% and 125%.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">axf:font-feature-settings, the &lt;axf:font-face&gt; element and the extended values of font-variant are not supported yet.</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">font-stretch</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;percentage&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Specifies the glyph width as a ratio of the original width.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;number&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Treated as a ratio of the number divided by 100.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported: the value is ignored</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:ligature-mode</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>No ligatures are used.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">latin</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Uses the ligatures of Western scripts (Latin, Greek and Cyrillic) (OpenType liga and clig).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: takes effect only when latin is written alone (combined with kana or jamo, Latin ligatures are not used)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">kana</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Uses the ligatures that combine a kana and a semi-voiced sound mark into one character (JIS X 0213:2004).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">jamo</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Uses the ligatures that compose Hangul jamo (U+1100–U+11FF).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">all</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Same as specifying latin, kana and jamo together.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: only Latin ligatures are used</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Uses kana ligatures, and leaves Latin and Hangul ligatures to the formatter's default.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported: no ligatures are used</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>

<?kumiori-sample id="axfx-9" mark="axf:ligature-mode=&quot;none&quot;|axf:ligature-mode=&quot;latin&quot;|font-stretch=&quot;75%&quot;|font-stretch=&quot;125%&quot;"?>
<fo:block font-family="serif" font-size="13pt" color="#23313a">
  <fo:inline axf:ligature-mode="none">office, fluffy</fo:inline>　<fo:inline
      axf:ligature-mode="latin" color="#b5562b">office, fluffy</fo:inline>
</fo:block>
<fo:block font-size="10pt" space-before="3pt" color="#23313a">
  <fo:inline font-stretch="75%">長体 75%</fo:inline>　<fo:inline>標準</fo:inline>　<fo:inline
      font-stretch="125%">平体 125%</fo:inline>
</fo:block>
<?kumiori-sample-end?>

<fo:block id="s-A-x12" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.16 </fo:inline>Footnote placement and numbering (axf:footnote-*)<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#b08132" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Partial</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">axf:footnote-position specifies where footnotes are placed.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">On fo:region-body, axf:footnote-position interprets the values page (the initial value), column (footnotes per column) and outside (side notes on horizontally written pages). With outside, footnotes are placed in fo:region-end on odd pages and in fo:region-start on even pages, at the height of the referencing line. The property on fo:footnote, and the other values, are not interpreted.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">axf:footnote-number (on the reference side) and axf:footnote-number-citation (on the footnote body side), which number footnotes automatically, are interpreted. The number format, starting value and reset are set by axf:footnote-number-format, axf:footnote-number-initial and axf:footnote-number-reset on fo:page-sequence. Numbers are assigned per fo:page-sequence and are not carried over from the previous fo:page-sequence.</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:footnote-position</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Placed on the after side of fo:region-body on each page (the bottom of the page in horizontal writing). The ordinary XSL footnote.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">odd-page | even-page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Collected on the after side of fo:region-body on odd (or even) pages.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">start | end</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Placed in fo:region-start (or fo:region-end) on each page.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">inside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Placed in fo:region-end on even pages and in fo:region-start on odd pages (side notes on the spine side in horizontal writing).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">outside</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Placed in fo:region-start on even pages and in fo:region-end on odd pages (side notes on the fore-edge side in horizontal writing).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: when specified on fo:region-body, and only on horizontally written pages</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">column</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Placed on the after side of each column. Without multi-column layout, same as page.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: only when specified on fo:region-body</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">start-column | end-column</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Collected on the after side of the first (or last) column.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">inside-column | outside-column</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>start-column and end-column, swapped between even and odd pages.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:footnote-number-format</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;string&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The format of the axf:footnote-number numbers (written like the format property; initial value 1).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:footnote-number-initial</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Carries the starting number over from the previous fo:page-sequence (1 if there is none).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: starts from 1 (not carried over from the previous fo:page-sequence)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;number&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The starting number (1 or greater). The counter returns to this value whenever axf:footnote-number-reset resets it.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:footnote-number-reset</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">auto</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Carries the setting over from the previous fo:page-sequence (none if there is none).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Partial: same as none (the previous fo:page-sequence's setting is not carried over)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">none</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Numbers are not reset.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Reset on every new page.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Supported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">odd-page | even-page</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Reset on every new odd (or even) page.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">column</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Reset on every new column.</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>
<fo:block id="s-A-x15" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.17 </fo:inline>Page backgrounds: background-color and axf:background-image<fo:inline space-start="0.8em" background-color="#b08132" color="#ffffff" font-size="6.5pt" padding="0.3pt 4pt" font-weight="normal" axf:border-radius="2pt">Partial</fo:inline></fo:block>
<fo:block font-size="7.8pt" line-height="1.55" color="#3b4245" background-color="#fbf5ea" padding="1.5mm 3mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">With the axf: extensions, a background color and a background image for the whole page can be specified on the page master or the page sequence.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">background-color on fo:simple-page-master (also under the name axf:background-color) is interpreted as the page background color. On fo:page-sequence, axf:background-image, axf:background-repeat and axf:background-position (also axf:background-position-horizontal and axf:background-position-vertical) are interpreted as the page background image.</fo:block>
<fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="2mm">background-image on fo:simple-page-master, and background-color, axf:background-color and background-image without the axf: prefix on fo:page-sequence, are not interpreted as page backgrounds. axf:background-size and axf:image-resolution are not interpreted.</fo:block>
<fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:image-resolution</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">normal</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Ignores the resolution stored in the image and sizes it at the formatter's default resolution (the CSS initial value).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">from-image</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Uses the resolution stored in the image. If the image has none, the &lt;dpi&gt; value is used; if that is absent too, same as normal (the XSL initial value).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">&lt;dpi&gt;</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Sizes the image at this resolution, ignoring the resolution stored in the image (dpcm may also be written).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-size="7.3pt" color="#3b4245" space-before="2mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" text-align="start">Values of <fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">axf:background-size</fo:inline></fo:block><fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="7.2pt" line-height="1.45" space-before="1mm" space-after="2mm"><fo:table-column column-width="32mm"/><fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/><fo:table-column column-width="34mm"/><fo:table-header><fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Value</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Meaning</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.8pt solid #23313a"><fo:block font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold">Kumiori</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-header><fo:table-body text-align="start"><fo:table-row keep-together.within-page="always"><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block><fo:inline font-family="monospace" font-size="6.8pt">[ &lt;length&gt; | &lt;percentage&gt; | auto ]{1,2} | cover | contain</fo:inline></fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>The size of the background image. Written as one or two of length, percentage or auto, or as cover (large enough to cover the area) or contain (large enough to fit within the area) (initial value auto).</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2pt 3pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cfd4d2"><fo:block>Unsupported</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row></fo:table-body></fo:table>
<!--/gen:ahsec-->
      <fo:block id="s-A-8" role="section" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="10.5pt" line-height="1.45" color="#23313a" space-before="8mm" space-after="1.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always"><fo:inline role="num">A.18 </fo:inline>Other axf: properties</fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">axf: properties and elements other than those covered in A.1–A.17 are not interpreted. Unknown axf: elements are reported by name with a warning when the document is read (unknown axf: properties are silently ignored).</fo:block>
      <!--gen:axf--><!--/gen:axf-->

      <!-- ──────────────── Appendix B -->
      <fo:block id="app-compat" break-before="page" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" color="#23313a" space-after="7mm" border-after-style="solid" border-after-width="0.6pt" border-after-color="#23313a" padding-after="2.5mm" keep-with-next.within-page="always" role="chapter"><fo:marker marker-class-name="chapter">Compatibility settings</fo:marker><!--tab:B--><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-odd"><fo:block padding-before="210.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-left-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-left-radius="2.5mm">B</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:marker marker-class-name="tab-even"><fo:block padding-before="210.0mm"><fo:block background-color="#c3ccc8" color="#ffffff" font-family="sans-serif" font-weight="bold" font-size="13pt" line-height="10.0mm" text-align="center" axf:border-top-right-radius="2.5mm" axf:border-bottom-right-radius="2.5mm">B</fo:block></fo:block></fo:marker><fo:block font-size="30pt" line-height="1.1" color="#c3ccc8">B</fo:block><fo:block font-size="18pt" line-height="1.35">Compatibility settings</fo:block></fo:block>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em">Kumiori has two compatibility modes for typesetting XSL-FO. The command-line option <fo:inline font-family="monospace" keep-together.within-line="always">--compat spec</fo:inline> (the default) typesets with the initial values and rules of XSL-FO 1.1 (this document is typeset in that mode). The other, <fo:inline font-family="monospace" keep-together.within-line="always">--compat antenna</fo:inline>, is the AH Formatter compatibility mode: when typesetting documents written for AH Formatter, it follows that formatter's conventions. The main differences are as follows.</fo:block>
      <fo:table table-layout="fixed" width="100%" border-collapse="collapse" font-size="8pt" space-before="3mm">
        <fo:table-column column-width="40mm"/>
        <fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
        <fo:table-column column-width="proportional-column-width(1)"/>
        <fo:table-header font-family="sans-serif" color="#ffffff" background-color="#1f3a5f">
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt"><fo:block>Item</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt"><fo:block>spec (default, per the spec)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt"><fo:block>antenna</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
        </fo:table-header>
        <fo:table-body text-align="start">
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>medium for font-size</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>12pt</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>10pt</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>thin, medium and thick for borders</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>0.75pt, 2.25pt, 3.75pt</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>1pt, 3pt, 5pt</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Antenna House extension values written on standard properties (the border styles dot-dash, dot-dot-dash and wave; a number for force-page-count)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Not values of XSL 1.1, so they are treated as if not specified and reported in a warning (the line styles written on axf: properties are interpreted)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Interpreted</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Line height (line-stacking)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>The rules of XSL 1.1 §4.5</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>AH Formatter-compatible rules</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Spacing between Japanese and Latin text</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Not inserted (inserted if specified)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Inserted (the initial value of axf:text-autospace is auto)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Punctuation compression and hanging punctuation</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Only when specified</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Compresses the space between consecutive punctuation marks, before opening brackets at the start of a paragraph, and after closing brackets and punctuation at the end of a line (no hanging punctuation)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Distribution of letter-spacing</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>The rules of XSL 1.1 §7.17.2 (half before and half after each character; the shares at the start and end of a line are discarded)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Added after every character</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Region borders</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Not drawn</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Drawn inside the region, with the content placed inside the border</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Line-start prohibition (kinsoku)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Small kana and the prolonged sound mark are not placed at the start of a line</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Small kana and the prolonged sound mark may start a line (the initial value of axf:line-break is normal)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Column rule and column gap</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>The column gap stays as column-gap</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>If the column rule is thicker than the column gap, the rule's thickness is added to the gap</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>font-stretch steps (ultra-condensed to ultra-expanded, wider, narrower)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>CSS ratios (50% to 200%)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>A factor of 1.2 per step</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Character at the end of a hyphenated line (when hyphenation-character is not specified)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>U+2010 (the initial value in XSL 1.1 §7.10.5)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>U+002D</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
          <fo:table-row><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>A “small-text fo:block + body-text fo:block” pair inside fo:inline-container (the way documents written for AH Formatter express ruby)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Typeset as an inline box (the two blocks are stacked and the baseline of the line of the first block is aligned to the baseline of the surrounding line; XSL 1.1 §6.6.8)</fo:block></fo:table-cell><fo:table-cell padding="2.5pt" border-after="0.4pt solid #cdc4b3"><fo:block>Typeset as ruby (the first block is the ruby text, the second the base text)</fo:block></fo:table-cell></fo:table-row>
        </fo:table-body>
      </fo:table>
      <fo:block text-indent="1em" space-before="3mm">The HTML option <fo:inline font-family="monospace">--style ah</fo:inline> (AH Formatter-compatible CSS typesetting) is described in the appendix of the “HTML and CSS” edition.</fo:block>

      <!-- ──────────────── Appendix C -->
